arent CrazyGames brand icon linked by the CrazyGames developer portal. The downloaded public image is bundled unchanged and identifies the platform, not an individual developer or an AI development tool.","language","en","获取方式","暂不可访问","access","section","源码","Platform listing is not game source — Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.","service","演示",[90],{"_68":91,"_32":92,"_93":94},"浏览 CrazyGames 游戏","https://www.crazygames.com/","note","Browser-game portal. Individual titles have their own input, device, and network requirements.","教程",[97],{"_68":98,"_32":99,"_93":100},"CrazyGames 发行文档","https://docs.crazygames.com/","Official requirements, SDK guides, testing tools, and launch workflow for web games.","来源核查","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[111,112],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[116],"stages","构建与发布","主题",[120,121,122],"tags","游戏发布","游戏发现","浏览器游戏","延伸阅读",[125,126,127],{"_68":91,"_32":92},{"_68":98,"_32":99},{"_68":128,"_32":129},"CrazyGames 发布要求","https://docs.crazygames.com/requirements/intro/","项目源码",[132],{"_68":130,"_32":73},"用途与特点","CrazyGames 面向玩家提供浏览器游戏，另有开发者门户及提交、技术要求、SDK 接入和测试文档。提交作品须经 QA 审核，Basic Launch 与 Full Launch 的要求及开放范围不同，并支持多种引擎导出的网页游戏。门户中的可玩构建不代表完整工程公开，也不能用来推断 AI 开发归因。","detail","guidance","资源类型","社区","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[164,165,166],{"_154":155,"_156":157,"_39":158},[153],[151,152],"2d","3d","ship","tutorial",{"_68":163,"_32":99,"_24":154,"_93":100},"demo",{"_68":162,"_32":92,"_24":87,"_93":94},{"_68":159,"_24":160,"_93":161},"Platform listing is not game source","unavailable","Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.","Browse games on CrazyGames","CrazyGames publishing documentation",{"_68":162,"_32":92},{"_68":163,"_32":99},{"_68":167,"_32":129},"CrazyGames submission requirements","resour