 guide to project information, uploads, classification, publishing, and updates.",[111,112],[116],[120,121,122,212],[342,343],{"_68":330,"_32":331},{"_68":335,"_32":336},[345],{"_68":130,"_32":346},"https://itch.io/developers","itch.io 让创作者管理游戏页面、截图、文件、开发日志与更新。HTML5 版本可在浏览器中运行，其他版本可按平台提供下载。项目页面也可能只包含试玩版或开发中的内容，应查看实际上传文件与运行说明。发布可玩版本并不等于公开完整源码。",[358,359],{"_154":352,"_156":353,"_39":354},[153],[151,152],{"_68":357,"_32":336,"_24":154,"_93":337},{"_68":356,"_32":331,"_24":87,"_93":332},{"_68":159,"_24":160,"_93":355},"Creators may publish source separately, but a game page or downloadable binary alone is not complete project source.","Browse games on itch.io","Create your first itch.io page",{"_68":356,"_32":331},{"_68":357,"_32":336},"resource:steamworks","steamworks","Steam","浏览桌面游戏，并通过 Steamworks 准备商店页面、构建、测试与发布。","/zh/resources/steamworks/",{"_26":361,"_144":362,"_141":145,"_64":146,"_143":363,"_135":410,"_32":389,"_65":411,"_83":412,"_119":404,"_115":413,"_110":414,"_103":102},[367,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378,379,380,381,382,383,384,385],{"_64":28,"_77":362,"_66":144,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":363,"_66":143,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":139,"_77":140,"_66":141,"_84":104,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":137,"_77":138,"_66":64,"_84":104,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":133,"_77":410,"_66":135,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":408,"_66":32,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":123,"_70":405,"_66":65,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_68":117,"_107":108,"_70":404,"_66":119,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":113,"_107":108,"_70":403,"_66":115,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":106,"_107":108,"_70":402,"_66":110,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":101,"_77":102,"_66":103,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":95,"_70":397,"_66":83,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":95,"_66":83,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":88,"_70":392,"_66":83,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":87,"_66":83,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":85,"_77":391,"_66":83,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_6