rain-chatgpt.webp","Word Rain in play, with falling letter tiles, a basket, target word, score, hearts, shield and speed indicators.","The running author-hosted game after start and ordinary direction-key basket movement.","https://octopuskid.github.io/word-rain/","media/learning/garden-match-agents.webp","A Garden Match fruit puzzle with a remaining-moves counter, apple objective, companion puppy, and settings button.","The local Garden Match project, using its documented development Canvas renderer.","https://github.com/kevinchenkai/GameAI/tree/main/garden","local-capture","2026-10-18T10:43:38.714Z","media/learning/dunkirk-ai-assisted.webp","A green player plane fires toward enemy aircraft above blue water and islands, with the score displayed.","The live Godot shooter after starting, moving, and firing at incoming aircraft.","https://cheery-sable-f2dce2.netlify.app/dunkirk.html","media/learning/gothicvania-codex.webp","GothicVania player jumps between platforms in a gothic interior with four health hearts.","Browser capture after entering the level, moving right, jumping, and attacking.","https://acatovic.github.io/gothicvania-codex-demo/","media/learning/pixel-princess-claude.webp","Pixel Princess heroine in the first forest level with apple pickups, an enemy, and the lives HUD.","Creator gameplay screenshot by Vito D’Elia, published in the project repository.","https://github.com/VTvito/pixel-princess-platformer/blob/main/assets/screenshot.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VTvito/pixel-princess-platformer/main/assets/screenshot.png","media/learning/running-man-claude-pixellab.webp","Running Man character crossing a scrolling road beneath a pixel-art mountain landscape.","Browser capture during a run after starting and jumping, with a live distance counter.","https://games.jdilig.me/games/running-man/","media/learning/bash-fighter-agent.webp","A twenty-fighter bot match with platforms, health percentages, and the Timed Brawl scoreboard.","Browser capture after creating a private lobby, starting with bots, and moving, jumping, and attacking.","https://bashfighter.com/","media/learning/flux-codex-runner.webp","Flux gravity runner in motion with the player, obstacle, trail, and mountain backdrop.","Browser capture after starting a run and flipping gravity.","https://codex-hackathon-drab.vercel.app/","media/learning/claude-mini-snake.webp","Mini Snake board after collecting food, with a three-segment snake and score two.","Browser capture after keyboard movement collected two food items; score rose from 0 to 2.","https://minisnake.vercel.app/","media/learning/cursor-procedural-platformer.webp","A yellow player jumps among platforms, collectibles, hazards, and enemies.","Browser capture after moving and jumping; score increased during the run.","https://commjoen.github.io/generated-game-experiment/","media/learning/claude-tower-defense.webp","Tower defense combat with a central tower, approaching enemies, and an upgraded Damage button.","Browser capture after buying a Damage upgrade; the game is fighting its first wave.","https://claude-game-lilac.vercel.app/","media/learning/agent-arcade-copilot.webp","https://github.com/DanWahlin/agent-arcade/blob/main/docs/images/agent-arcade-ninja.gif","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DanWahlin/agent-arcade/main/docs/images/agent-arcade-ninja.gif","Ninja Runner plays as a transparent overlay above the creator’s code editor, with the character, ground, obstacles, lives, and score.","A still from the creator’s Ninja Runner gameplay recording (GIF frame 20).","media/learning/quasar-saz-claude.webp","https://github.com/cleak/quasar-saz/blob/master/docs/screenshot_20260219_154704.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cleak/quasar-saz/master/docs/screenshot_20260219_154704.png","A colorful musical boss battle with the Dissonance King health bar, instrument projectiles, energy, and score.","The creator’s boss-battle screenshot with musical projectiles, score, and energy HUD.","media/lear