lth and ammo HUD.","Creator screenshot rendered by the real game engine through its desktop test simulator.","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D/main/screenshots/03_ghoul_attack.png","media/learning/pixel-orchard-astra.webp","Two revealed seed-packet symbols on a twelve-card memory board, with one move and zero matched pairs.","The author-hosted memory game after revealing two cards.","https://miaai-lab.github.io/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/013-pixel-orchard.html","media/learning/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra.webp","Zen mode with split fruit, a visible slicing trail, score 8 and a four-hit combo.","The author-hosted game after a normal mouse-drag slice.","https://fruit-ninja-dojo-20260905.yongqixue666.chatgpt.site/","media/learning/thunderfall-astra.webp","THUNDERFALL fighter dodging lasers and bullets in the Molten Foundry, with weapon and flight HUD.","The creator-published Molten Foundry practice screenshot.","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/blob/ed10f435bfd298df8f88175c5cdb6405842a0da0/assets/screenshots/thunderfall/gameplay.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/ed10f435bfd298df8f88175c5cdb6405842a0da0/assets/screenshots/thunderfall/gameplay.jpg","media/learning/nagi-home-cowork.webp","Nagi the blue crab in a furnished three-dimensional home, with daily needs, food placement feedback and the ball activity.","The live Cowork-created simulation after placing food on the floor and throwing a ball.","https://tanuu5.github.io/nagi-home/","media/learning/clockout-unseen-codex.webp","Office-stealth gameplay with the player behind desks, a coworker, a minimap and 149 seconds remaining.","The public Bilibili Toy build during an opening Normal-mode movement check.","https://www.bilibili.com/toy/clockout-unseen/index.html","media/learning/fishslop-claude.webp","A submarine in a three-dimensional reef with ruins, fish, feeding particles, coins and a recharging sonar display.","The live reef after steering, feeding, coin feedback and sonar, using the low-quality preset.","https://vasu-devs.github.io/FishSlop_Opus5.5/","media/learning/pelican-bike-claude.webp","A white pelican riding a bicycle along a three-dimensional coast, with speed, distance, fish and achievement HUD.","The live coastal ride after acceleration, a first jump and a camera change.","https://claude-opus-5-5.riba2534.cn/","media/learning/three-kingdoms-codex.webp","Fifteen-city Three Kingdoms map, Liu Bei resources, Chengdu development commands and the end-turn control.","The creator’s running v0.2.0 strategy-map screenshot.","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/blob/ed10f435bfd298df8f88175c5cdb6405842a0da0/assets/screenshots/three-kingdoms/gameplay.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/ed10f435bfd298df8f88175c5cdb6405842a0da0/assets/screenshots/three-kingdoms/gameplay.jpg","media/learning/fang-fox-gbc-claude.webp","Fang faces the crowned Goo King and slimes in the Game Boy Color edition, with health and level HUD.","Creator-published gameplay image from the Game Boy Color release page.","https://tinybitadventures.com/games/fang-the-fox-gbc/","https://tinybitadventures.com/content/11/uploads/2026/09/fang-gbc-goo-king.png","media/learning/vibe-golf-bevy.webp","Vibe Golf active gameplay with an orange ball, trees and mushrooms on hilly terrain, speed and target-distance HUD.","GameMap browser capture after Play and an ordinary mouse charge/release action.","https://ahammer.github.io/vibe_golf/","media/learning/core-business-claude.webp","The Core Business mining vehicle in a three-dimensional side-view Mars scene, with fuel, hull, cargo, money and depth indicators.","The running author-hosted mining tech demo, captured with the Metal rendering backend.","https://leichtbier.github.io/core-business/","media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp","A duck thief and its recorded clone in the opening museum