149,"_93":1150},"Open the complete 3D game source","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/squash_the_creeps","Complete GDScript project with scenes, character assets, score, and retry behavior. Match the project branch to your Godot version.","playable","试玩与运行",[1154],{"_68":1155,"_32":1156,"_93":1157},"Play Squash the Creeps","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/3d/squash_the_creeps/","Official browser build with a moving character and enemy interactions. A WebGL-capable browser and keyboard are required.","游戏平台","浏览器","开发记录与教程",[1162],{"_68":1163,"_32":1164,"_93":-7},"Follow the official 3D tutorial","https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.html","研究这个工作流",true,[1169,1170,1171,1172],"steps","Play the browser demo and test movement, jumping, enemy contact, and retry.","Follow the official 3D game tutorial and compare its scenes with the completed project.","Ask an agent to adjust one mechanic, such as jump height or enemy spawning.","Replace one asset at a time and check collision shapes, scale, animation, and performance.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Use the working project as an agent-readable reference for movement, collisions, animation, and score. Add generated assets only after the original game loop works.","aiUse","创作方式","人工编写的引擎基础示例","provenance","方向","track","引擎","Godot · 3D","engine",[1169,1170,1171,1172],{"_68":1163,"_32":1164},{"_68":1155,"_32":1156,"_24":1151,"_93":1157},{"_68":1148,"_32":1149,"_93":1150},[1189,1190,1191,1192],"godot-engine","godot-demo-projects","godot-mcp","blender","foundation:phaser-starshake","phaser-starshake","把浏览器射击游戏带到移动端","试玩完整太空射击游戏 Starshake，再跟随官方教程适配移动端控制与布局，这条路径基于已有游戏继续开发。","/zh/examples/phaser-starshake/",{"_26":1194,"_141":1109,"_1180":151,"_28":1195,"_30":1196,"_1183":1247,"_1175":1246,"_1168":1248,"_154":1249,"_156":1250,"_39":1251,"_1133":1252},[1201,1202,1203,1204,1205,1206,1207,1208,1209,1210,1211,1212,1213],"Take a browser shooter to mobile",{"_64":2