-ksp/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","Source download. Extract it and run python3 start.py; a browser opens on localhost:8000. The main game is 2D; a 3D assembly workbench is included.","源码下载","指南形式","disclosure",[1470],{"_68":1471,"_32":731,"_93":-7},"Read the creator’s project and run guide",[1473,1474,1475,1476],"Download the repository and run python3 start.py, or open index.html.","Follow the built-in tutorial to assemble, launch, and stage a rocket.","Read the Chinese README and compare the orbital rules with js/game.js.","Inspect the optional 3D construction workbench as a separate subsystem.","创作者在仓库描述中说明使用 DeepSeek Harness。项目提供路线图与开发步骤，没有公开原始模型对话。","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","Canvas 2D · JavaScript","ai-assisted",[1473,1474,1475,1476],{"_68":1471,"_32":731,"_24":1468},{"_68":1463,"_32":1464,"_24":1460,"_93":1465},{"_68":1458,"_32":731,"_93":1459,"_1489":1490},{"_68":1452,"_32":731,"_93":1453},[1487,1488],"deepseek-agent-integrations","threejs","scope","complete-project","example:deepseek-neon-snake","Snake：霓虹街机版","霓虹贪吃蛇，包含关卡、变化的速度和网格尺寸、键盘与触屏输入，以及可保存的最高分。","/zh/examples/deepseek-neon-snake/",{"_26":541,"_28":1492,"_30":1493,"_1183":1479,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":1544,"_1168":1545,"_154":1546,"_156":1547,"_39":1548,"_1450":1549,"_1133":1550},[1498,1499,1500,1501,1502,1503,1504,1505,1506,1507,1508,1509,1510,1511,1512,1513,1514,1515,1516],"Snake: Neon Arcade Edition",{"_64":28,"_77":1492,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":1493,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1479,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":1544,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":1539,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":1536,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68"