-trebacz/tower-of-time-game/blob/main/PROMPTS.md",[3846,3847,3848,3849],"Play the game and try building defenses, surviving waves, and rewinding time.","Read the Rewindable Sprite prompts and the follow-up reports that refine the mechanic.","Trace how the author supplied file context, documentation, and observed errors to the agents.","Compare the prompt history with the complete project, including scenes, gameplay systems, and assets.","作者使用 Augment Code 与 Cursor 代理，主要模型为 Claude Sonnet 4，同时也在 Phaser Editor 中手动编辑代码和安排场景。",[3846,3847,3848,3849],{"_68":3843,"_32":3844,"_24":2773},{"_68":3839,"_32":632,"_24":1151,"_93":3840},{"_68":2034,"_32":3835,"_93":3836,"_1489":1490},{"_68":2651,"_32":3831,"_93":3832},[1253,1254],"example:claude-agent-team-tetris","Tetris：代理团队协作开发","完整的浏览器俄罗斯方块，作者公开说明三个 Claude Code 队友如何分别负责规则、渲染与控制。","/zh/examples/claude-agent-team-tetris/",{"_26":585,"_28":3858,"_30":3859,"_1183":1479,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":3910,"_1168":3911,"_154":3912,"_156":3913,"_39":3914,"_1450":3915,"_1133":3916},[3864,3865,3866,3867,3868,3869,3870,3871,3872,3873,3874,3875,3876,3877,3878,3879,3880,3881,3882],"Tetris built by an AI agent team",{"_64":28,"_77":3858,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":3859,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1479,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":3910,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":3905,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":3901,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":3897,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":3893,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":14