961},"Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix","Includes the Godot project, scripts, shaders, models, textures, audio, and generation scripts. Local play requires Godot 4.7 standard; API access is only needed to regenerate assets.",[3963],{"_68":3964,"_32":640,"_93":3965},"Play TRON: EXONIX","Creator-hosted Godot web build. Click to enter the grid, press Space to deploy, use the arrow keys to move, and Escape for the menu. A keyboard and a WebGL-capable browser are recommended.",[3967],{"_68":3968,"_32":3969,"_93":-7},"Follow the creator’s complete workflow","https://www.top3d.ai/learn/claude-godot-mcp-3d-game",[3971,3972,3973,3974],"Play the web build and study territory capture, trail hazards, enemy movement, and sector progression.","Follow the creator’s tutorial from prototype through materials, audio, effects, and web export.","Read CLAUDE.md to understand the agent, Godot MCP, Blender review, and asset-generation workflow.","Open game/project.godot in Godot 4.7 and press F5; study the scripts alongside the included models, textures, and audio.","作者记录 Claude 编写玩法、着色器、视觉特效和 UI，人工引导机制与材质。仓库包含实际 Godot 游戏、生成资产及资产生成脚本。",[1138,3977,3978,3424,3979,3980],"Nano Banana","PATINA","Stable Audio","ElevenLabs","Godot 4.7 · GDScript",[1138,3977,3978,3424,3979,3980],[3971,3972,3973,3974],{"_68":3968,"_32":3969,"_24":154},{"_68":3964,"_32":640,"_24":1151,"_93":3965},{"_68":3959,"_32":3960,"_1489":1490,"_93":3961},{"_68":3954,"_32":3955,"_93":3956},[1781,1189,1191,3989],"mcp-for-blender","example:moonlight-mayhem-codex","Moonlight & Mayhem","用 Codex 制作的 3D 博物馆劫案：救出两只浣熊队友、躲避安保、叠起小队，偷走金色沙丁鱼。","/zh/examples/moonlight-mayhem-codex/",{"_26":581,"_28":3991,"_30":3992,"_1183":1605,"_3423":4046,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":4044,"_1168":4047,"_154":4048,"_156":4049,"_39":4050,"_1450":4051,"_1133":4052},[3996,3997,3998,3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015],{"_64":28,"_77":3991,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":3992,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":4045,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4044,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4039,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4035,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4031,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4027,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4022,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4018,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4017,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":643,"_599":4016,"_601":642,"_39":644,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":608,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/moonlight-mayhem-codex.webp",[2206],[4019,4020,4021],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},{"_68":1221,"_32":1222},[4023],{"_68":4024,"_32":4025,"_93":4026},"Read the published Codex transcript","https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/blob/main/transcript.md","The creator links this development record from the build account; it accompanies the game source rather than a generator-only repository.",[4028],{"_68":2010,"_32":4029,"_93":4030},"https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/","Actual game source, committed textures, vendored Three.js, build notes, and transcript. No build step is required; use a local static HTTP server to run the repository.",[4032],{"_68":4033,"_32":644,"_93":4034},"Play Moonlight & Mayhem","Desktop: WASD or arrows to move, E to interact, Space or Shift to dash, Escape to pause. Mobile uses a touch stick and action buttons. Requires a WebGL-capable browser.",[4036],{"_68":4037,"_32":4038,"_93":-7},"Read the creator’s build and fix log","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/7/moonlight-mayhem/",[4040,4041,4042,4043],"Play the heist and trace crew rescue, security detection, interactions, and escape.","Read the creator’s build account and compare the original brief with the result.","Follow the transcript and commit history to study scene construction, generated art, and the visual bug fix.","Serve the complete repository locally, then study one mechanic and its supporting assets.","Simon Willison 记录了向 Codex 提供游戏简报和图像生成权限，再提出视觉缺陷修复的过程。公开项目包含游戏、生成纹理和开发对话。",[3789],[3789],[4040,4041,4042,4043],{"_68":4037,"_32":4038,"_24":1782},{"_68":4033,"_32":644,"_24":1151,"_93":4034},{"_68":2034,"_32":4029,"_1489":1490,"_93":4030},{"_68":4024,"_32":4025,"_93":4026},[1314,1488,1255],"example:dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli","Dinosaur Game Offline：Gemini CLI 辅助跑酷","控制像素恐龙跳过仙人掌、躲避飞行障碍，随分数增长体验加速。这个浏览器小游戏包含完整 JavaScript 实现、精灵与音效。","/zh/examples/dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli/",{"_26":503,"_28":4054,"_30":4055,"_1183":4109,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":4108,"_1168":4110,"_154":4111,"_156":4112,"_39":4113,"_1450":4114,"_1133":4115},[4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067,4068,4069,4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078],"Dinosaur Game Offline: Gemini CLI-assisted runner",{"_64":28,"_77":4054,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4055,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4109,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4108,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4102,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4099,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4095,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4090,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4085,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4082,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4080,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":824,"_599":4079,"_601":823,"_39":825,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":826,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli.webp",[4081],"Gemini CLI",[4083],{"_68":4081,"_32":4084},"/zh/resources/gemini-cli/",[4086],{"_68":4087,"_32":4088,"_93":4089},"See the creator’s Gemini CLI disclosure","https://github.com/tonidevvn/dinosaur-game-offline#how-gemini-cli-helped","README, repository description, and the in-game footer explicitly name gemini-cli. This establishes creator attribution rather than independent proof of fully autonomous generation.",[4091],{"_68":4092,"_32":4093,"_93":4094},"Open the complete dinosaur game source","https://github.com/tonidevvn/dinosaur-game-offline","Complete index.html, style.css, script.js, and referenced image/audio assets. Public source is available, but the repository does not declare a code license.",[4096],{"_68":4097,"_32":825,"_93":4098},"Play Dinosaur Game Offline","Author-hosted browser build; earlier catalog notes report a Chromium check, not independently revalidated here. Space starts and jumps; after a collision, click the restart icon. Desktop keyboard recommended because the board has a fixed 900-pixel width. The full project can also run locally by opening index.html.",[4100],{"_68":4101,"_32":4088,"_93":-7},"Read how Gemini CLI helped",[4103,4104,4105,4106,4107],"Open the author-hosted browser game on a desktop with a keyboard. Press Space once to start, then press Space again to jump over an approaching cactus.","Watch the score rise, test a collision, and use the restart icon after game over. Earlier catalog notes report a start/jump/score/collision/restart smoke test and a preview captured during a jump. That run was not repeated or independently validated in this source-only review.","To run locally, download the complete dinosaur-game-offline repository and open index.html. Keep style.css, script.js, and public/ beside it. No npm installation, build step, Gemini CLI, or API key is needed to play.","If a browser restricts local files, serve the repository with python3 -m http.server 8080 and open http://localhost:8080. The game board is fixed at 900 pixels wide and targets desktop keyboard play. Its optional Google Fonts stylesheet uses the network.","Read the creator’s disclosure, then inspect script.js for the requestAnimationFrame loop, jump state, obstacle spawning, scoring, collision checks, and restart behavior.","作者在 README 和游戏页脚明确说明 Gemini CLI 参与了脚手架、玩法逻辑、调试和改进。没有公开原始对话或确切模型标识，应视为有记录的辅助开发。","DOM / CSS · JavaScript",[4103,4104,4105,4106,4107],{"_68":4101,"_32":4088,"_24":1468},{"_68":4097,"_32":825,"_24":1151,"_93":4098},{"_68":4092,"_32":4093,"_93":4094,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4087,"_32":4088,"_93":4089},[4116],"gemini-cli","example:cloud-crush-gemini-cli","Cloud Crush：用 Gemini CLI 制作消除游戏","在 8×8 棋盘上匹配云服务图标，争夺限时高分并创造特殊 Gemini 宝石。Google 公开完整 Go 游戏及 Gemini CLI 开发教程。","/zh/examples/cloud-crush-gemini-cli/",{"_26":501,"_28":4118,"_30":4119,"_1183":4177,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":4176,"_1168":4178,"_154":4179,"_156":4180,"_39":4181,"_1450":4182,"_1133":4183},[4124,4125,4126,4127,4128,4129,4130,4131,4132,4133,4134,4135,4136,4137,4138,4139,4140,4141,4142,4143],"Cloud Crush: Gemini CLI builds a match-3 game",{"_64":28,"_77":4118,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4119,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4177,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4176,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4169,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4165,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":95,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":2085,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4160,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1460,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4155,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4150,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4148,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4147,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":829,"_599":4146,"_601":828,"_39":830,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":608,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4144},[4145],{"_68":1922,"_32":831},"/GameMap/media/learning/cloud-crush-gemini-cli.webp",[4081],[4149],{"_68":4081,"_32":4084},[4151],{"_68":4152,"_32":4153,"_93":4154},"See Google’s explicit Gemini CLI attribution","https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/blob/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang/README.md","The publisher README explicitly names Gemini CLI; the separate official codelab records the development prompts and human steering workflow.",[4156],{"_68":4157,"_32":4158,"_93":4159},"Open the complete Go game project","https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/tree/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang","Includes main.go, source images and audio, go.mod, browser entry and runtime helper, server/main.go, Dockerfile, and publisher screenshots. The repository code is Apache-2.0. A WASM binary must be built locally.",[4161],{"_68":4162,"_32":4163,"_93":4164},"Download & run Cloud Crush","https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/blob/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang/README.md#local-development","Local Go / WASM project; no hosted public game endpoint was verified. Use Go 1.26.2+ and run go run . from the game directory. Expand the steps for the complete browser build, asset copy, matching wasm_exec.js, and local server commands. Native play needs a graphical desktop and working audio drivers. Cloud Crush was not compiled locally in this review.",[4166],{"_68":4167,"_32":4168,"_93":-7},"Follow Google’s Gemini CLI game codelab","https://codelabs.developers.google.com/next26/gemini-cli-match3-golang",[4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175],"Download the devrel-demos repository and enter codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang. Install Go 1.26.2 or newer; the README’s 1.24+ prerequisite is outdated. For native desktop play, run: go run .","Follow the title and player-name prompts. Use arrow keys to move the cursor and Space to select a gem, then an arrow to swap. Mouse/touch input is also implemented. Compare matching, falling tiles, time bonuses, and score behavior with main.go.","For a local browser build, first prepare the files served by the Go server: mkdir -p public/assets; cp assets/* public/assets/; cp index.html public/index.html. The committed public/assets directory is missing source files required by the game, including background.jpg.","Use the WASM helper from the same Go installation as the compiler: cp \"$(go env GOROOT)/lib/wasm/wasm_exec.js\" public/wasm_exec.js. Then compile: GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build -o public/cloud-crush.wasm .","Run the browser server from the same game directory: go run server/main.go. Open http://localhost:8080. Local play does not require Gemini CLI, an API key, a Google Cloud account, or cloud deployment.","Read the official codelab to trace the development prompts. The browser instructions above were checked against source; this review did not install Go or compile the game. Its preview is a publisher-provided gameplay screenshot.","Google 在仓库中将游戏生成归属于 Gemini CLI，官方 codelab 展示人工通过 Plan 模式、引导提示、浏览器适配、测试和子代理组织开发。这是发布方的开发记录，不是独立测量的自主创作比例。","Ebitengine 2 · Go / WebAssembly",[4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175],{"_68":4167,"_32":4168,"_24":154},{"_68":4162,"_32":4163,"_24":1460,"_93":4164},{"_68":4157,"_32":4158,"_93":4159,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4152,"_32":4153,"_93":4154},[4116],"example:roo-code-action","Action with AI：Roo Code 开发实验","使用 SVG 呈现的俯视角动作原型，包含鼠标瞄准射击、敌人和攻击预警，并附有按提示逐步实现的开发记录。","/zh/examples/roo-code-action/",{"_26":499,"_28":4185,"_30":4186,"_1183":4235,"_1180":151,"_1175":4234,"_1168":4236,"_154":4237,"_156":4238,"_39":4239,"_1450":4240,"_141":1480,"_1133":4241},[4191,4192,4193,4194,4195,4196,4197,4198,4199,4200,4201,4202,4203,4204,4205,4206,4207,4208],"Action with AI: a Roo Code experiment",{"_64":28,"_77":4185,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4186,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4235,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4234,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4229,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4226,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4222,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4217,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4212,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4210,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":834,"_599":4209,"_601":833,"_39":835,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/roo-code-action.webp",[4211],"Roo Code",[4213],{"_68":4214,"_32":4215,"_93":4216},"阅读最初的 AI 开发记录","https://zenn.dev/mizchi/articles/game-with-cline","The author names Roo Code and Claude 3.5 Sonnet, explains the no-direct-coding constraint and documents the human design and steering role.",[4218],{"_68":4219,"_32":4220,"_93":4221},"查看完整动作游戏原型","https://github.com/mizchi/action-with-ai","Complete React/TypeScript project with SVG rendering, movement, collision, combat, shared types, tests and development notes. No repository license file was found in the reviewed tree.",[4223],{"_68":4224,"_32":835,"_93":4225},"Play Action with AI","Early desktop keyboard-and-mouse prototype. WASD moves and holding the mouse button fires; visual polish and a full commercial campaign are outside its scope.",[4227],{"_68":4228,"_32":4215,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 Roo Code 实验记录",[4230,4231,4232,4233],"Move with WASD, aim with the mouse and hold the mouse button to shoot.","Read the original sequence from rendering and movement through enemy health and attack warnings.","Inspect docs/overview.md, the shared types and combat modules alongside the creator’s discussion of documentation drift.","For local study, install the project dependencies with the documented pnpm setup and run pnpm dev, then change one attack or movement rule.","Mizchi 明确使用 Roo Code（原 Roo Cline）和 Claude 3.5 Sonnet，并禁止人工直接改代码。人类提供基于开发经验的设计、逐步指令和架构约束。原文保留了工作方法与限制，这仍是早期原型。","React · SVG · TypeScript",[4230,4231,4232,4233],{"_68":4244,"_32":4215,"_24":1782},{"_68":4224,"_32":835,"_24":1151,"_93":4225},{"_68":4243,"_32":4220,"_93":4221,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4242,"_32":4215,"_93":4216},[],"Read the original AI development account","Open the complete action prototype","Read the creator’s Roo Code experiment","example:three-quake-claude-port","Three Quake：AI 辅助移植 Quake","在 Three.js 浏览器移植版中试玩 Quake 共享版篇章，研究如何借助 AI 改造已有射击游戏的渲染与运行时。","/zh/examples/three-quake-claude-port/",{"_26":497,"_28":4246,"_30":4247,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_1175":4298,"_1168":4299,"_154":4300,"_156":4301,"_39":4302,"_1450":4303,"_1133":4304,"_141":1480},[4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257,4258,4259,4260,4261,4262,4263,4264,4265,4266,4267,4268,4269,4270],"Three Quake: an AI-assisted Quake port",{"_64":28,"_77":4246,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4247,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4298,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4293,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4289,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4285,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4280,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4275,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4273,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4272,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":838,"_599":4271,"_601":837,"_39":839,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/three-quake-claude-port.webp",[1579],[4274],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[4276],{"_68":4277,"_32":4278,"_93":4279},"查看作者的 AI 协助与原作署名","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake#credits","The maintainer distinguishes id Software’s original game from the Three.js port made with Claude assistance.",[4281],{"_68":4282,"_32":4283,"_93":4284},"查看完整浏览器移植项目","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake","Complete browser port, maps, runtime source and tests, with the shareware pak0.pak. Code is GPL-2.0; original Quake game data has separate terms and is not relicensed by the code license.",[4286],{"_68":4287,"_32":839,"_93":4288},"Play Three Quake","Keyboard, mouse and a WebGL-capable browser. The included shareware data covers Episode 1; full-game content is separate.",[4290],{"_68":4291,"_32":4292,"_93":-7},"查看移植署名与作者开发日志","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake#dev-log",[4294,4295,4296,4297],"Open the browser build, start a new single-player game and test the movement and firing controls.","Read the creator’s port credits and dev log alongside the original id Software source reference.","Inspect the browser renderer, game runtime, maps and tests to trace how the existing game was adapted.","Use the included shareware data for Episode 1; a registered full-game data set is separate and must be supplied by its owner.","Mr.doob 将 Claude 列为 Three.js 移植工作的协助者。Quake 的原始设计与实现来自 id Software，本例是 AI 辅助移植，不能表述成 AI 创作了 Quake。README 链接开发记录，但没有明确具体 Claude 客户端。",[4294,4295,4296,4297],{"_68":4307,"_32":4292,"_24":1468},{"_68":4287,"_32":839,"_24":1151,"_93":4288},{"_68":4306,"_32":4283,"_93":4284,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4305,"_32":4278,"_93":4279},[1488],"Read the author’s AI and original-game credits","Open the complete browser port","Read the port credits and creator dev log","example:crown-defender-codex","Crown Defender TD 3D · Codex build","在等距视角下操控英雄，抵挡三十波敌人保护城堡，通过升级组合赢得装饰皇冠。","/zh/examples/crown-defender-codex/",{"_26":495,"_28":4309,"_30":4310,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_141":2298,"_1175":4360,"_1168":4361,"_154":4362,"_156":4363,"_39":4364,"_1450":4365,"_1133":4366},[4314,4315,4316,4317,4318,4319,4320,4321,4322,4323,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332],{"_64":28,"_77":4309,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4310,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4360,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4355,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4352,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1466,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4347,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1460,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4343,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4338,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4335,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4334,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":842,"_599":4333,"_601":841,"_39":843,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1436},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":844,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/crown-defender-codex.webp",[2206],[4336,4337],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[4339],{"_68":4340,"_32":4341,"_93":4342},"查看作者的开发代理署名","https://github.com/Aleksandr-Litvinenko/Codex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game/blob/main/COMPARISON.md","Author-published Russian comparison explicitly states that Codex built this version from the same requirements as the Claude Code project; no raw session is published.",[4344],{"_68":4345,"_32":843,"_93":4346},"查看完整 Codex 游戏项目","Includes game.js, interface, bundled Three.js, runtime textures, requirements and optional WebSocket relay. No build or dependency installation for solo play. MIT code; see ASSET_CREDITS.md.",[4348],{"_68":4349,"_32":4350,"_93":4351},"Download and run Crown Defender","https://github.com/Aleksandr-Litvinenko/Codex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","Static browser game. Run python3 -m http.server 8010 and open localhost:8010/index.html; choose Играть (Play). Russian interface. WASD/arrows move; semicolon attacks. Mobile joystick/buttons included. Optional two-player mode requires node server/multiplayer-server.mjs.",[4353],{"_68":4354,"_32":4341,"_93":-7},"查看同一需求下的代理对比",[4356,4357,4358,4359],"Serve the project locally and enter TD Defense.","Read the original requirements and same-brief comparison.","Inspect hero movement, wave progression and upgrade logic.","Change one upgrade and test losing, retrying and saved progress.","Aleksandr-Litvinenko 将此版本归功于 Codex，并公开与相同需求下 Claude Code 版本的比较。作者表示比较针对两种代理最初的实现选择；此仓库提供运行所需的代码和素材。",[4356,4357,4358,4359],{"_68":4369,"_32":4341,"_24":1782},{"_68":4349,"_32":4350,"_24":1460,"_93":4351},{"_68":4368,"_32":843,"_1489":1490,"_93":4346},{"_68":4367,"_32":4341,"_93":4342},[1314,1488],"Read the author’s agent attribution","Open the complete Codex game project","Read the same-brief agent comparison","example:arkanoid-neon-claude","Arkanoid Neon","让球反弹穿过八种霓虹砖块布局，收集强化道具，并应对逐渐加快的节奏。这款完整浏览器游戏使用 Canvas 2D 与实时合成的 Web Audio。","/zh/examples/arkanoid-neon-claude/",{"_26":493,"_28":4371,"_30":4372,"_1183":4425,"_1180":151,"_141":2298,"_1175":4424,"_1168":4426,"_154":4427,"_156":4428,"_39":4429,"_1450":4430,"_1133":4431},[4376,4377,4378,4379,4380,4381,4382,4383,4384,4385,4386,4387,4388,4389,4390,4391,4392,4393,4394,4395],{"_64":28,"_77":4371,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4372,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4425,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4424,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4419,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4416,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":2773,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4411,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4406,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4402,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4400,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4399,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":847,"_599":4398,"_601":846,"_39":848,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4396},[4397],{"_68":1922,"_32":849},"/GameMap/media/learning/arkanoid-neon-claude.webp",[1744],[4401],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},[4403],{"_68":4404,"_32":848,"_93":4405},"查看作者的 Claude Code 使用说明","The creator directly names Claude Code and its model, separates the original request from the finished project, and describes code-generated art/audio. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[4407],{"_68":4408,"_32":4409,"_93":4410},"查看完整浏览器游戏","https://github.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon","Complete index.html, style.css and game.js with procedural graphics and audio; open index.html locally, no build step. Google Fonts is optional and falls back to system fonts offline. No root LICENSE was found. Fan project inspired by Arkanoid, not affiliated with Taito.",[4412],{"_68":4413,"_32":4414,"_93":4415},"Play Arkanoid Neon","https://jack-c3l2w.github.io/arkanoid-neon/","Mouse, arrows or A/D move; click/Space launches and fires; P/Esc pauses. Touch drag and tap are supported.",[4417],{"_68":4418,"_32":848,"_93":-7},"阅读作者最初的要求",[4420,4421,4422,4423],"Play a stage and compare paddle control, collision behavior, power-ups and losing a life.","Read the creator’s original Swedish request and AI attribution.","Open index.html locally and trace the game loop, level data and procedural graphics in game.js.","Ask an agent to change one brick pattern or power-up, then test launching, losing a life and restarting.","作者在瑞典语 README 中明确表示，代码、画面、音效、音乐与关卡由 Claude Code 配合 Claude Opus 5.5 完成，并公开最初的一句话要求。这是作者的开发说明，不是独立审核过的完整生成记录。","Custom Canvas 2D · JavaScript · Web Audio",[4420,4421,4422,4423],{"_68":4434,"_32":848,"_24":2773},{"_68":4413,"_32":4414,"_24":1151,"_93":4415},{"_68":4433,"_32":4409,"_1489":1490,"_93":4410},{"_68":4432,"_32":848,"_93":4405},[1781],"Read the creator’s Claude Code attribution","Open the complete browser game","Read the creator’s original request","example:supermarket-simulator-cursor","Supermarket Simulator","以第一人称经营超市：订货、拆包、补货，并在收银台服务顾客。作者使用 Cursor 完成这个 Unity 实验，并使用 Hunyuan 生成 3D 模型。","/zh/exa