s and ProjectSettings. Scenes, prefabs and models use Git LFS: clone with LFS and run git lfs pull before opening Assets/Scenes/InitScene.unity. MIT code; Unity, generated models and dependencies retain their terms. LFS objects were not fetched in this review.",[4478],{"_68":4479,"_32":4480,"_93":4481},"Download the Windows game","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator/releases/download/0.0.1/SupermarketSimulator.zip","Windows download, about 397 MB, from release 0.0.1. Extract and run Supermaket Simulator.exe. Other platforms require a source build; the binary was not downloaded or executed in this review.",[4483],{"_68":4484,"_32":853,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明",[4486,4487,4488,4489],"Download the Windows release and try the order, delivery, stocking and checkout loop.","Read the creator’s build account and linked video to separate coding assistance from generated models.","Clone with Git LFS, fetch the LFS objects and open InitScene in the matching Unity editor.","Adjust one stock, customer or checkout behavior with an agent, then compare a complete customer-service loop.","作者明确列出 Cursor，以及 Gemini 2.5 Pro、Claude Opus 4 和 Claude Sonnet 4，并提供制作视频。“全部由 AI 生成”是作者的开发说明；代码协作、Unity 项目与模型生成需要分别理解。","Unity 2023.2.6f1 · URP · C#",[4486,4487,4488,4489],{"_68":4500,"_32":853,"_24":1468},{"_68":4479,"_32":4480,"_24":1460,"_93":4481},{"_68":2034,"_32":4475,"_93":4476,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":853,"_93":4472},[4498],"unity-engine","Read the creator’s AI attribution","Read the creator’s development disclosure","example:magic-carpet-wizard-astra","Magic Carpet Wizard · A Thousand Skies","驾驶飞毯掠过微型球形世界，穿越计分圆环、使用三种法术并迎战敌人与首领。本地幽灵竞速支持两人轮流挑战。","/zh/examples/magic-carpet-wizard-astra/",{"_26":489,"_28":4502,"_30":4503,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":4551,"_1168":4552,"_154":4553,"_156":4554,"_39":4555,"_1450":4556,"_1133":4557},[4507,4508,4509,4510,4511,4512,4513,4514,4515,4516,4517,4518,4519,4520,4521,4522,4523,4524,4525],{"_64":28,"_77":4502,"_66":28,"_84":-7,