adventure run and test flight and spells.","Read the creator’s attribution and audio notes.","Inspect flight rules, collision and rendering modules.","Adjust one obstacle or spell and test a retry and ghost race.","作者在仓库简介中将游戏归功于 GPT-6 Astra。README 说明场景和贴图由程序生成，音频由外部提供；没有公开提示、完整会话或人类与模型工作的精确比例。",[4547,4548,4549,4550],{"_68":4560,"_32":4533,"_24":1468},{"_68":4541,"_32":858,"_24":1151,"_93":4542},{"_68":4559,"_32":4533,"_1489":1490,"_93":4538},{"_68":4558,"_32":4533,"_93":4534},[1488],"See the creator’s Astra attribution","Open the complete carpet-flight project","Read the creator’s implementation guide","example:sakura-crossing-qwen","3D Sakura Crossing：本地 Qwen 探索原型","探索卡通渲染的日本街区，体验运行中的铁路道口、居民对话、开合桥、可驾驶小车与可游泳河流。","/zh/examples/sakura-crossing-qwen/",{"_26":487,"_28":4562,"_30":4563,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":4616,"_1168":4617,"_154":4618,"_156":4619,"_39":4620,"_1450":4621,"_1133":4622},[4568,4569,4570,4571,4572,4573,4574,4575,4576,4577,4578,4579,4580,4581,4582,4583,4584,4585,4586,4587],"3D Sakura Crossing: an exploration prototype",{"_64":28,"_77":4562,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4563,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4616,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4611,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4607,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4602,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4599,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4594,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4592,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4591,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":862,"_599":4590,"_601":861,"_39":863,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4588},[4589],{"_68":1922,"_32":864},"/GameMap/media/learning/sakura-crossing-qwen.webp",[1744],[4593],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[4595],{"_68":4596,"_32":4597,"_93":4598},"查看 Qwen 与作者的开发分工","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing#credits","README explicitly distinguishes locally generated Qwen code from human review, debugging, and extensions. The creator’s linked Reddit build account identifies Claude Code CLI as the harness, not the Claude model.",[4600],{"_68":2829,"_32":863,"_93":4601},"GPL-3.0 source with complete index.html, vendored Three.js, procedural textures, and implementation notes. Run python3 -m http.server 5191 and open localhost:5191/index.html; file:// loading is unsupported. The original author has ended active development. The creator describes an exploration prototype, not a finished campaign; no complete win/loss loop is claimed.",[4603],{"_68":4604,"_32":4605,"_93":4606},"Explore Sakura Crossing","https://danymaniglie-cmyk.github.io/3d-sakura-crossing/","Exploration prototype. WASD walks, Shift runs, mouse drag looks, E talks, F enters/exits the car, and Space/C swims up/down. Touch controls included; mobile performance remains limited.",[4608],{"_68":4609,"_32":4610,"_93":-7},"阅读渲染与实现指南","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/blob/main/CARTOON.md",[4612,4613,4614,4615],"Explore the browser world on foot, then try the car, river, and moving bridge.","Read the credits and the author’s account of using a local Qwen model through Claude Code CLI.","Inspect CARTOON.md and the complete index.html plus vendored Three.js dependency.","Serve a local copy over HTTP, change one interaction, and verify movement and collisions.","仓库说明代码由本地运行的 Qwen 3.8 27B 生成，再由人手工审查、调试与扩展。作者的开发帖子进一步说明使用 Claude Code CLI 作为执行工具，底层模型为 Qwen。",[4612,4613,4614,4615],{"_68":4624,"_32":4610,"_24":1782},{"_68":4604,"_32":4605,"_24":1151,"_93":4606},{"_68":2852,"_32":863,"_1489":1490,"_93":4601},{"_68":4623,"_32":4597,"_93":4598},[1488],"Read the Qwen and human contribution credit","Read the rendering and implementation recipe","example:claude-dreaming-godot","Claude Dreaming","从像素风阁楼走入可玩的 3D 画作，探索梦境花园、太空飞行、小行星与社区共同制作的房间。","/zh/examples/claude-dreaming-godot/",{"_26":485,"_28":4626,"_30":4627,"_1183":3981,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":4678,"_1168":4679,"_154":4680,"_156":4681,"_39":4682,"_1450":4683,"_1133":4684},[4631,4632,4633,4634,4635,4636,4637,4638,4639,4640,4641,4642,4643,4644,4645,4646,4647,4648,4649,4650],{"_64":28,"_77":4626,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4627,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":3981,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4678,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4673,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4669,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":95,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4665,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4661,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4657,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4655,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4654,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":867,"_599":4653,"_601":866,"_39":868,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4651},[4652],{"_68":1922,"_32":869},"/GameMap/media/learning/claude-dreaming-godot.webp",[1579],[4656],{"_68":1144,"_32":1145},[4658],{"_68":4659,"_32":868,"_93":4660},"查看作者的 AI 开发分工说明","The creator explicitly credits Claude and discloses assisted code, graphics, sounds, and text. This is an author disclosure and contribution workflow, not a complete development transcript.",[4662],{"_68":2143,"_32":4663,"_93":4664},"https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming","Full scenes, GDScript, levels, rooms, assets, film intro, and export presets. Run with Godot 4.7.2 standard: import project.godot and press F5. Code is MIT; original assets are CC BY 4.0, while film material and film-derived art have project-only restrictions in NOTICE.md.",[4666],{"_68":4667,"_32":868,"_93":4668},"Play Claude Dreaming","In-development HTML5 game. WASD moves; mouse looks, Space jumps/glides, E enters paintings, R respawns, and Esc pauses. Menus are German; Claude speaks English. The film intro can be skipped.",[4670],{"_68":4671,"_32":4672,"_93":-7},"阅读用 Claude 添加梦境的指南","https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md",[4674,4675,4676,4677],"Start the browser build; hold Enter to skip the film if desired.","Enter a painting and compare its movement with the attic and community rooms.","Import the full project in Godot 4.7.2 standard, then read the level template and contribution guide.","Create one small level through the published API and test entry, movement, respawn, and returning to the attic.","Rusty 将作品署名为 Rusty 与 Claude，并披露代码、图像、声音和文字均有 AI 辅助。仓库提供贡献说明与关卡接口，方便继续与 Claude 一起制作新梦境。",[4674,4675,4676,4677],{"_68":4686,"_32":4672,"_24":154},{"_68":4667,"_32":868,"_24":1151,"_93":4668},{"_68":2177,"_32":4663,"_1489":1490,"_93":4664},{"_68":4685,"_32":868,"_93":4660},[1189],"Read the creator’s AI contribution disclosure","Read how to add a dream with Claude","example:sprout-quest-claude","Sprout Quest","探索小世界，参加实时竞技场战斗，采集材料、锻造装备并重建村庄。Sprout Quest 面向竖屏手机，将二维世界与实时渲染的三维角色、道具组合在一起。","/zh/examples/sprout-quest-claude/",{"_26":483,"_28":4688,"_30":4689,"_1183":4744,"_3423":4745,"_1180":151,"_141":2298,"_1175":4742,"_1168":4746,"_154":4747,"_156":4748,"_39":4749,"_1450":4750,"_1133":4751},[4693,4694,4695,4696,4697,4698,4699,4700,4701,4702,4703,4704,4705,4706,4707,4708,4709,4710,4711,4712,4713],{"_64":28,"_77":4688,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":4689,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4744,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":4743,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4742,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4737,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4735,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4730,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4726,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4722,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4718,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4717,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":872,"_599":4716,"_601":871,"_39":873,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4714},[4715],{"_68":1922,"_32":874},"/GameMap/media/learning/sprout-quest-claude.webp",[1744],[4719,4720,4721],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},{"_68":1138,"_32":1139},[4723],{"_68":4471,"_32":4724,"_93":4725},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#how-it-was-built","README separates the original build from later human playtest/AI iteration; publishes source modules, generated models and runtime assets, plus a prompt summary. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[4727],{"_68":2010,"_32":4728,"_93":4729},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest","Complete game code, runtime GLBs/sprite atlases, Blender scripts and tests. bun install then bun run dev opens localhost:3000; normal builds use committed art and do not require Blender. No root LICENSE was found, so public source visibility does not establish broad reuse permission.",[4731],{"_68":4732,"_32":4733,"_93":4734},"Play Sprout Quest","https://aibengineering.github.io/sprout-quest/","Author-hosted browser adventure designed for portrait phones, with desktop keyboard controls and localStorage saves.",[4736],{"_68":2711,"_32":4724,"_93":-7},[4738,4739,4740,4741],"Play the portrait-browser prologue and follow its first fight, gathering and forge tasks.","Read the build account to see how human phone playtests guided later Claude Code changes.","Run bun install and bun run dev; inspect the game modules, committed runtime assets and Blender builders.","Change one combat, crafting or story rule with an agent, then replay the affected progression and save flow.","作者称游戏、测试与 Blender 美术流程均由 Claude Code 根据自然语言要求完成；人类负责在手机上试玩并反馈。仓库同时提供运行素材和素材生成脚本，可以研究试玩反馈如何推动后续修改。",[1138],"Custom Canvas 2D + Three.js · TypeScript",[1138],[4738,4739,4740,4741],{"_68":2725,"_32":4724,"_24":1782},{"_68":4732,"_32":4733,"_24":1151,"_93":4734},{"_68":2034,"_32":4728,"_93":4729,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":4724,"_93":4725},[1781,1488,1192],"example:mosswing-astra","Mosswing","通过单键振翅让小生物保持飞行，穿过不断滚动的石柱缺口，在精简的 3D 网页游戏中挑战更高分。","/zh/examples/mosswing-astra/",{"_26":481,"_28":4753,"_30":4754,"_1183":4801,"_1180":152,"_141":2298,"_1175":4800,"_1168":4802,"_154":4803,"_156":4804,"_39":4805,"_1450":4806,"_1133":4807},[4758,4759,4760,4761,4762,4763,4764,4765,4766,4767,4768,4769,4770,4771,4772,4773,4774,4775],{"_64":28,"_77":4753,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4754,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4801,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4800,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4795,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4792,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":2773,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4788,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4783,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4778,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4777,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":877,"_599":4776,"_601":876,"_39":878,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":879,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/mosswing-astra.webp",[2335],[4779],{"_68":4780,"_32":4781,"_93":4782},"查看作者的测试与提示","https://github.com/Ayi1337/gpt6-astra-one-shot-games#02--mosswing","The author labels this an Astra one-shot test and preserves the initial instructions and generated artifact. The coding-agent client is not identified.",[4784],{"_68":4785,"_32":4786,"_93":4787},"查看完整 Mosswing 源码","https://github.com/Ayi1337/gpt6-astra-one-shot-games/tree/main/mosswing","Contains the complete standalone HTML and separate source files. No package installation or build step is required. A public source license was not observed.",[4789],{"_68":4790,"_32":878,"_93":4791},"Play Mosswing","Designed for a mobile browser with one-tap control. The repository also supplies a standalone mosswing.html that can be opened in a modern browser without installation.",[4793],{"_68":4794,"_32":4781,"_93":-7},"阅读单次生成的原始提示",[4796,4797,4798,4799],"Play and identify gravity, flap impulse and scoring.","Read the original prompt alongside the single HTML result.","Inspect the separate source folder before editing.","Change one flight parameter and compare collision and restart behavior.","Ayi1337 公开了 Astra 原始提示和单文件 HTML 结果，称其为一次 Xhigh 的单轮测试。人类规定振翅、重力、碰撞和得分规则，并要求原创角色、世界与画风；这是作者陈述，没有完整生成轨迹。","Three.js · JavaScript · WebGL",[4796,4797,4798,4799],{"_68":4810,"_32":4781,"_24":2773},{"_68":4790,"_32":878,"_24":1151,"_93":4791},{"_68":4809,"_32":4786,"_1489":1490,"_93":4787},{"_68":4808,"_32":4781,"_93":4782},[],"Read the creator’s test and prompt","Open the complete Mosswing source","Read the original one-shot prompt","example:astra-floor-ai","Astra Floor","在第一人称工业场地中抵挡六波僵尸并挑战最终首领，管理弹药、后坐力、体力和每轮间的商店采购。","/zh/examples/astra-floor-ai/",{"_26":479,"_28":4812,"_30":4813,"_1183":4866,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":4865,"_1168":4867,"_154":4868,"_156":4869,"_39":4870,"_1450":4871,"_1133":4872},[4817,4818,4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,4826,4827,4828,4829,4830,4831,4832,4833,4834,4835,4836],{"_64":28,"_77":4812,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4813,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4866,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4865,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4860,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4857,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4852,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4847,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4843,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":4841,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4840,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":882,"_599":4839,"_601":881,"_39":883,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4837},[4838],{"_68":1922,"_32":884},"/GameMap/media/learning/astra-floor-ai.webp",[2132,3269],[4842],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[4844],{"_68":4845,"_32":883,"_93":4846},"查看作者说明的 AI 分工","The repository owner’s submission distinguishes Astra from Antigravity work. The README also credits both tools; no full conversation archive is supplied.",[4848],{"_68":4849,"_32":4850,"_93":4851},"查看完整 FPS 游戏项目","https://github.com/BEROCHLU/astrafloor","Game implementation, procedural models, bundled textures/music and tests. Node.js 22.13+; npm install then npm run dev. Third-party texture credits are documented separately.",[4853],{"_68":4854,"_32":4855,"_93":4856},"Play Astra Floor","https://astrafloor.berochlu.workers.dev/","Desktop WebGL, keyboard and mouse. Wait for INITIALIZING to finish, choose a difficulty, then DEPLOY. WASD moves, mouse aims/fires, R reloads, Q heals, G throws a grenade, and V uses melee. Runs are not saved. The in-app browser could not capture the mouse during review; a normal desktop browser is recommended.",[4858],{"_68":4859,"_32":883,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 AI 开发说明",[4861,4862,4863,4864],"Choose Normal difficulty and enter the first wave.","Read the creator’s architecture and model disclosure.","Inspect procedural weapons, enemies and audio implementation.","Tune one weapon or enemy and verify a wave and shop transition.","BEROCHLU 表示 GPT-6 Astra 参与了大量架构、程序化 3D 生成和 Web Audio 合成，Antigravity 2.0 完成其他实现与迭代打磨。作者没有宣称这是一次提示完成的作品。","Three.js · TypeScript (React UI)",[4861,4862,4863,4864],{"_68":4875,"_32":883,"_24":1468},{"_68":4854,"_32":4855,"_24":1151,"_93":4856},{"_68":4874,"_32":4850,"_1489":1490,"_93":4851},{"_68":4873,"_32":883,"_93":4846},[1488],"Read the author’s division of AI work","Open the complete FPS project","Read the creator’s AI development disclosure","example:isocoaster-cursor","IsoCoaster","铺设过山车轨道、安排游乐设施，经营有游客活动的主题公园。IsoCoaster 与 IsoCity 共用仓库，但拥有独立的可玩游戏和页面入口。","/zh/examples/isocoaster-cursor/",{"_26":477,"_28":4877,"_30":4878,"_1183":4925,"_1180":151,"_14