wser theme-park builder; the shared source repository contains its separate coaster route.",[4918],{"_68":4484,"_32":888,"_93":-7},[4920,4921,4922,4923],"Play the theme park builder and inspect how coaster tracks, rides and guests interact.","Run the repository locally and open /coaster rather than the city-building route.","Compare the coaster-specific state and interface with the shared isometric rendering components.","Ask an agent to adjust one ride or guest behavior, then test construction, simulation and save/load.","作者在两个游戏的共同 README 中明确说明使用 Cursor，但没有公开具体模型或完整对话。可以比较共享等距渲染器如何支撑不同的模拟和操作界面。","Custom Canvas 2D · TypeScript",[4920,4921,4922,4923],{"_68":4500,"_32":888,"_24":1468},{"_68":4914,"_32":4915,"_24":1151,"_93":4916},{"_68":2034,"_32":4910,"_93":4911,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":888,"_93":4907},[],"example:spirit-of-kiro","Spirit of Kiro","寻找奇特物品，在工坊中组合、拆解或改变它们，再交给 AI 估价师出售，体验开放式合成玩法。","/zh/examples/spirit-of-kiro/",{"_26":475,"_28":4933,"_30":4934,"_1183":4986,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":4985,"_1168":4987,"_154":4988,"_156":4989,"_39":4990,"_1450":4991,"_1133":4992},[4938,4939,4940,4941,4942,4943,4944,4945,4946,4947,4948,4949,4950,4951,4952,4953,4954,4955,4956],{"_64":28,"_77":4933,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4934,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4986,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":4985,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":4980,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":4977,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":95,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1466,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":4972,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1460,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":4967,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":4962,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":4960,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":892,"_599":4959,"_601":891,"_39":893,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":4957},[4958],{"_68":1922,"_32":894},"/GameMap/media/learning/spirit-of-kiro.webp",[4961],"Kiro",[4963],{"_68":4964,"_32":4965,"_93":4966},"阅读官方 Kiro 开发说明","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro#spirit-of-kiro","Official creator statement reports more than 95% prompted code. The core crafting loop is complete; roadmap features and intentionally unfinished challenge-branch tasks remain separate.",[4968],{"_68":4969,"_32":4970,"_93":4971},"查看完整合成游戏项目","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro","MIT-0 game repository with Vue client, Bun server, item-image service, infrastructure, and deployment documentation. Runtime item text and interactions depend on AWS Bedrock; item-image generation has additional optional model requirements.",[4973],{"_68":4974,"_32":4975,"_93":4976},"Download and run Spirit of Kiro","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No anonymous hosted game is linked by the official project. Local play requires Docker/Podman, an AWS account/credentials and CLI, Bedrock access to supported text models, and deployed Cognito resources. Follow docs/local-setup.md to launch the stack and bootstrap DynamoDB. AWS runtime usage can incur charges; source-checked steps, not executed.",[4978],{"_68":4979,"_32":893,"_93":-7},"跟随官方边玩边学指南",[4981,4982,4983,4984],"Read the official setup guide and confirm the AWS model access required for the runtime.","Deploy the Cognito resources, start the client/server stack, and bootstrap the local DynamoDB tables.","Play the discover, craft, and sell loop before attempting the challenge branch.","Follow one guided bug fix or feature change and verify the resulting interaction in the game.","Kiro 官方项目说明超过 95% 的代码通过提示 Kiro 编写。配套指南使用这个实际游戏讲解引导文件、修复、重构、规格、钩子与 MCP；游戏运行时也用 AI 生成物品及合成结果。","Custom Vue 3 · DOM/CSS sprites · TypeScript",[4981,4982,4983,4984],{"_68":4995,"_32":893,"_24":154},{"_68":4974,"_32":4975,"_24":1460,"_93":4976},{"_68":4994,"_32":4970,"_1489":1490,"_93":4971},{"_68":4993,"_32":4965,"_93":4966},[],"Read the official Kiro development disclosure","Open the complete crafting-game project","Follow the official learn-by-playing guide","example:rhythm-master-windsurf","Rhythm Master 3D","四轨音乐节奏游戏，包含合成器曲目、难度选择、连击和特殊模式，完整实现集中在一个浏览器 HTML 文件中。","/zh/examples/rhythm-master-windsurf/",{"_26":473,"_28":4997,"_30":4998,"_1183":5049,"_1180":152,"_1175":5048,"_1168":5050,"_154":5051,"_156":5052,"_39":5053,"_1450":5054,"_1133":5055,"_141":1480},[5002,5003,5004,5005,5006,5007,5008,5009,5010,5011,5012,5013,5014,5015,5016,5017,5018,5019,5020],{"_64":28,"_77":4997,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":4998,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5049,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5048,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5043,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5040,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1466,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5035,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1460,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5031,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5026,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":5024,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5022,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":897,"_599":5021,"_601":896,"_39":898,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1436},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/rhythm-master-windsurf.webp",[5023,1579],"Windsurf",[5025],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[5027],{"_68":5028,"_32":5029,"_93":5030},"查看作者使用的 AI 工具与提示词","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/frankniu_if-youre-not-vibe-coding-with-claude-sonnet-activity-7304977951761039362-2xQe","The creator identifies Claude Sonnet 3.7, describes passing output into Windsurf, and links the exact rhythm-game repository in the same post.",[5032],{"_68":5033,"_32":898,"_93":5034},"查看完整音游源码","The full game is rhythm.html, with procedural music and geometry rather than a separate asset download. Third-party libraries load from CDNs. No repository code license is declared.",[5036],{"_68":5037,"_32":5038,"_93":5039},"Download and run Rhythm Master 3D","https://github.com/frankjniu/rhythm-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No public hosted build was verified. Serve the downloaded directory and open rhythm.html. External CDNs supply Three.js and Tone.js, so internet access is needed; a click starts audio.",[5041],{"_68":5042,"_32":5029,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的开发流程",[5044,5045,5046,5047],"Download the repository and serve its directory with a local HTTP server, then open rhythm.html.","Choose a track and difficulty, start the game, and use D/F/J/K as notes reach the target zone.","Test combo scoring, Escape pause and the Space special mode before changing timing or difficulty.","Compare the single-file implementation with the creator’s original brief and debugging workflow.","Frank Niu 在作者帖子中链接这款游戏，并描述 Claude Sonnet 3.7 网页对话与 Windsurf 配合的流程：先生成初版，在对话中诊断问题，再由 Windsurf 应用修改。这是人工引导的开发案例，没有证据表明使用了 Claude Code 或一次自主运行完成。","Three.js · Tone.js · JavaScript",[5044,5045,5046,5047],{"_68":5058,"_32":5029,"_24":1782},{"_68":5037,"_32":5038,"_24":1460,"_93":5039},{"_68":5057,"_32":898,"_93":5034,"_1489":1490},{"_68":5056,"_32":5029,"_93":5030},[1488],"Read the author’s AI tools and prompt disclosure","Open the complete rhythm-game source","Read the creator’s build workflow","example:pokemon-tactics-claude","Pokemon Tactics","让宝可梦在等距战场上移动，利用高低差，并在范围攻击时避开队友。这款可玩的同人战棋采用 TypeScript 模拟核心、2D-HD 精灵和 Babylon.js 地形。","/zh/examples/pokemon-tactics-claude/",{"_26":471,"_28":5060,"_30":5061,"_1183":5112,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":5111,"_1168":5113,"_154":5114,"_156":5115,"_39":5116,"_1450":5117,"_1133":5118},[5065,5066,5067,5068,5069,5070,5071,5072,5073,5074,5075,5076,5077,5078,5079,5080,5081,5082,5083,5084],{"_64":28,"_77":5060,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5061,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5112,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5111,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5106,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5104,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5099,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5095,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5091,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":5089,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5088,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":901,"_599":5087,"_601":900,"_39":902,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5085},[5086],{"_68":1922,"_32":903},"/GameMap/media/learning/pokemon-tactics-claude.webp",[1744],[5090],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},[5092],{"_68":4471,"_32":5093,"_93":5094},"https://github.com/kekel87/pokemon-tactics#built-with-ai","Author explains human direction versus generated implementation; independent itch page repeats AI and art disclosure. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[5096],{"_68":2010,"_32":5097,"_93":5098},"https://github.com/kekel87/pokemon-tactics","Complete pnpm workspace with game core, Pokemon data, Babylon renderer, UI and app assets. package.json requires Node >=24 and pnpm 10.32.1; pnpm install then pnpm dev. Code MIT; many sprites/tiles use CC BY-NC 4.0 and some effect particles have no separate license. Noncommercial fan project; read CREDITS.md.",[5100],{"_68":5101,"_32":5102,"_93":5103},"Play Pokemon Tactics","https://kekel87.itch.io/pokemon-tactics","Author-hosted browser demo on itch.io; choose Run game. Includes AI opponents and hot-seat play. An in-development fan project.",[5105],{"_68":4484,"_32":5093,"_93":-7},[5107,5108,5109,5110],"Play a battle against the built-in opponents and test movement, height, type matchups and friendly fire.","Read the AI disclosure and CREDITS.md before exploring the engine and rendering packages.","Use Node 24 or later and pnpm 10.32.1 to run the complete workspace locally.","Change one tactical rule with an agent, then compare battle resolution, team setup and replay behavior.","作者负责设计与架构，Claude Code 与专门代理编写大部分代码、测试和文档。宝可梦数据、精灵图及部分 PixelLab 美术另有署名与使用条件，不能与代码许可混为一谈。","Babylon.js · TypeScript",[5107,5108,5109,5110],{"_68":4500,"_32":5093,"_24":1468},{"_68":5101,"_32":5102,"_24":1151,"_93":5103},{"_68":2034,"_32":5097,"_93":5098,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":5093,"_93":5094},[1781],"example:clowder-and-crest-agents","Clowder & Crest","招募猫咪组成中世纪公会，在十五类小游戏中接取任务、培养羁绊，并体验受公会声望影响的七章剧情。","/zh/examples/clowder-and-crest-agents/",{"_26":469,"_28":5120,"_30":5121,"_1183":2234,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5182,"_1168":5183,"_154":5184,"_156":5185,"_39":5186,"_1450":5187,"_1133":5188,"_2148":5189},[5125,5126,5127,5128,5129,5130,5131,5132,5133,5134,5135,5136,5137,5138,5139,5140,5141,5142,5143,5144],{"_64":28,"_77":5120,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5121,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":2234,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":118