and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","GitHub Releases · Android","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.8.0","Download — Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.",[5171],{"_68":5172,"_32":907,"_93":5173},"Play Clowder & Crest","Browser campaign with mouse/touch minigames. The title screen also offers a spoiler-marked unlocked minigame archive. Android/iOS packaging is included, but native installation has separate platform requirements. Initial asset loading can be slow.",[5175],{"_68":5176,"_32":5154,"_93":-7},"查看作者的工具与代码署名",[5178,5179,5180,5181],"Start a guild and complete an opening job.","Read the tool credits and separate coding lanes.","Inspect one minigame and its dedicated playtest.","Change one job mechanic and check campaign progression and saves.","JacobStephens2 将 Claude Code 列为主要代码与设计伙伴，Codex CLI 和 Gemini CLI 分别承担第二、第三条编码任务线。PixelLab、Midjourney、ElevenLabs 和 Suno 生成不同种类的素材，仓库保留了分工具的任务文件。",[5178,5179,5180,5181],{"_68":5196,"_32":5154,"_24":1468},{"_68":5172,"_32":907,"_24":1151,"_93":5173},{"_68":5195,"_32":5159,"_1489":1490,"_93":5160},{"_68":5194,"_32":5154,"_93":5155},[1253,1314,4116],[5190,5191],{"_2175":5167,"_32":5168,"_24":1460,"_93":5193},{"_2175":5164,"_32":5165,"_24":1460,"_93":5192},"Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","Read the creator’s multi-tool attribution","Open the complete guild-game project","Read the creator’s tool and code credits","example:novel-journey-to-west","西游记：三借芭蕉扇","把三借芭蕉扇篇章改编为中文回合制 RPG，包含彩绘场景行走、任务、装备、宠物和指令战斗。","/zh/examples/novel-journey-to-west/",{"_26":467,"_28":5198,"_30":5199,"_1183":5251,"_1180":151,"_1175":5250,"_1168":5252,"_154":5253,"_156":5254,"_39":5255,"_1450":5256,"_141":1480,"_1133":5257},[5204,5205,5206,5207,5208,5209,5210,5211,5212,5213,5214,5215,5216,5217,5218,5219,5220,5221,5222],"Journey to the West: Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan",{"_64":28,"_77":5198,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5199,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5251,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5250,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5245,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5242,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5237,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5232,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5227,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5226,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":911,"_599":5225,"_601":910,"_39":912,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5223},[5224],{"_68":1922,"_32":913},"/GameMap/media/learning/novel-journey-to-west.webp",[2335],[5228],{"_68":5229,"_32":5230,"_93":5231},"阅读作者的流程与案例记录","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game#play-online","The creator links the game to the NovelToGame workflow and its adaptation workspace. Published QA is author evidence, not a GameMap reproduction.",[5233],{"_68":5234,"_32":5235,"_93":5236},"查看完整改编资料与游戏","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/journey-to-the-west","Includes the static game, painted scene and character assets, design workspace and browser QA. No generation API is required to play the committed build. Repository MIT terms and the source/asset ledgers should be read together.",[5238],{"_68":5239,"_32":5240,"_93":5241},"Play Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","https://xiyouji.vibecoco.ai/","Chinese-language browser prototype. Click to walk, interact with marked NPCs and choose battle commands. The author records a desktop completion path; narrow-screen play has separate limitations.",[5243],{"_68":5244,"_32":5235,"_93":-7},"查看改编工作资料",[5246,5247,5248,5249],"Play the village and use the quest tracker to reach an NPC or a battle.","Compare the novel chapter references with the selected fan, transformation and five-element mechanics.","Read the design, art and QA files to distinguish implemented systems from deliberately omitted multiplayer features.","To run locally, serve examples/journey-to-the-west/build/app with python3 -m http.server 5173; inspect the JavaScript battle implementation before changing a rule.","Zenstory 将该游戏作为 NovelToGame 代理工作流的产物发布，提供原著分析、被淘汰的概念、玩法与美术设计、生成美术、完整实现及 QA 记录。案例没有明确某一个编码客户端，不能从工具支持列表推断所有客户端都参与了制作。","Custom Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM UI",[5246,5247,5248,5249],{"_68":5260,"_32":5235,"_24":1782},{"_68":5239,"_32":5240,"_24":1151,"_93":5241},{"_68":5259,"_32":5235,"_93":5236,"_1489":1490},{"_68":5258,"_32":5230,"_93":5231},[],"Read the creator’s workflow and example record","Open the complete adaptation and game","Read the adaptation workspace","example:vibe-racer-opencode","Vibe Racer","俯视角计时赛车，包含本地最佳成绩、玩家与作者的幽灵车、泥地路面，以及内置赛道编辑器。","/zh/examples/vibe-racer-opencode/",{"_26":465,"_28":5262,"_30":5263,"_1183":5319,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5318,"_1168":5320,"_154":5321,"_156":5322,"_39":5323,"_1450":5324,"_1133":5325},[5267,5268,5269,5270,5271,5272,5273,5274,5275,5276,5277,5278,5279,5280,5281,5282,5283,5284,5285,5286],{"_64":28,"_77":5262,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5263,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5319,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5318,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5313,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5310,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1466,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5305,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1460,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5300,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5295,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":5292,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5290,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":916,"_599":5289,"_601":915,"_39":917,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5287},[5288],{"_68":1922,"_32":918},"/GameMap/media/learning/vibe-racer-opencode.webp",[5291],"OpenCode",[5293],{"_68":5291,"_32":5294},"/zh/resources/opencode/",[5296],{"_68":5297,"_32":5298,"_93":5299},"查看 OpenCode 与模型署名","https://github.com/Kecksdose/vibe_racer#development","Creator disclosure explicitly names OpenCode and GPT 5.2 Codex. The model name does not imply the Codex coding-agent client was used.",[5301],{"_68":5302,"_32":5303,"_93":5304},"查看完整赛车游戏项目","https://github.com/Kecksdose/vibe_racer","MIT-licensed game source with supplied maps, replays, screenshots, and pyproject.toml/uv.lock. Python 3.12+; the graphical game needs a local desktop display.",[5306],{"_68":5307,"_32":5308,"_93":5309},"Download and run Vibe Racer","https://github.com/Kecksdose/vibe_racer/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No hosted browser build. Requires Python 3.12+ and Pygame 2.6.1+. Run uv run -m src.main; alternatively pip install -e . then python -m src.main. Arrow keys drive, R restarts, G toggles the ghost, and B returns to track selection. Source-checked launch steps; not executed.",[5311],{"_68":5312,"_32":5298,"_93":-7},"查看工具与模型使用说明",[5314,5315,5316,5317],"Download the source and launch the Pygame window with Python 3.12 or newer.","Race a supplied track and compare the player ghost with the unlockable creator ghost.","Read the development disclosure, then inspect movement, lap timing, and replay storage.","Change a track or handling parameter and complete a validation run before saving.","Kecksdose 明确写出使用 OpenCode 编程工具与 GPT 5.2 Codex 模型。README 提供简短开发说明，尚未公开原始提示词或完整对话。","Pygame 2.6 · Python",[5314,5315,5316,5317],{"_68":5329,"_32":5298,"_24":1468},{"_68":5307,"_32":5308,"_24":1460,"_93":5309},{"_68":5328,"_32":5303,"_1489":1490,"_93":5304},{"_68":5327,"_32":5298,"_93":5299},[5326],"opencode","See OpenCode and model attribution","Open the complete racing project","Read the tool and model disclosure","example:golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","Golden Hour Skatepark","在原创海边滑板场中压弯、起跳、翻板、滑杆、平衡，摔倒后重新上板。这是完整的第三人称滑板沙盒，显示短暂的技巧连段，支持切换日照，没有关卡或持久积分。","/zh/examples/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor/",{"_26":463,"_28":5331,"_30":5332,"_1183":5390,"_3423":5391,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":5388,"_1168":5392,"_154":5393,"_156":5394,"_39":5395,"_1450":5396,"_1133":5397},[5336,5337,5338,5339,5340,5341,5342,5343,5344,5345,5346,5347,5348,5349,5350,5351,5352,5353,5354,5355,5356],{"_64":28,"_77":5331,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5332,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5390,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":5389,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5388,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5383,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5379,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5374,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5369,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5364,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":5361,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5360,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":921,"_599":5359,"_601":920,"_39":922,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5357},[5358],{"_68":1922,"_32":923},"/GameMap/media/learning/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor.webp",[1809],[5362,5363],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},{"_68":1138,"_32":1139},[5365],{"_68":5366,"_32":5367,"_93":5368},"阅读作者的 Cursor 开发记录","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park#how-it-was-built","The README explicitly names Cursor AI agents and separates builder passes, critic feedback and human playtests; docs/MAKING-OF.md provides a detailed account. Source-checked; performance and playability claims were not reproduced.",[5370],{"_68":5371,"_32":5372,"_93":5373},"查看完整滑板游戏项目","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park","Complete TypeScript game, procedural park code, runtime skater/crowd GLBs, textures, audio and source tools. CI uses Node 22 and pnpm 10.18.0; pnpm install then pnpm dev at 127.0.0.1:5188. Ports are fixed. No root LICENSE was found; CC0 media, Mixamo animations and dependencies keep separate terms.",[5375],{"_68":5376,"_32":5377,"_93":5378},"Play Golden Hour Skatepark","https://starknightt.github.io/skate-park/","Browser skating sandbox with keyboard, optional mouse/gamepad and touch controls. Press any key, click or tap to take over from the title-screen rider. Phone testing reported by the creator used desktop emulation; Firefox and desktop Safari remain untested.",[5380],{"_68":5381,"_32":5382,"_93":-7},"阅读实现与评审协作记录","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/blob/main/docs/MAKING-OF.md",[5384,5385,5386,5387],"Play the park and test pushing, carving, one trick, a bail and recovery.","Read the making-of account and separate human feedback, agent implementation and third-party assets.","Use Node 22 with pnpm 10.18.0, then pnpm install and pnpm dev; inspect the collision mesh and character pipeline.","Ask an agent to adjust one movement or camera parameter, then compare transition riding, tricks and recovery across the park.","作者明确表示，Cursor 的 AI 代理通过实现与视觉评审轮次开发游戏，人类试玩推动了控制方式的修改。代码构建的场景与程序化滑行动作，配合 Cursor 生成画作，以及另行署名的 CC0 声音、纹理和 Mixamo 摔倒起身动画。",[1138],"Three.js · TypeScript",[1138],[5384,5385,5386,5387],{"_68":5400,"_32":5382,"_24":1782},{"_68":5376,"_32":5377,"_24":1151,"_93":5378},{"_68":5399,"_32":5372,"_1489":1490,"_93":5373},{"_68":5398,"_32":5367,"_93":5368},[1488,1192],"Read the creator’s Cursor contribution account","Open the complete skating project","Read the builder-and-critic development account","example:castle-clash-duel-claude","Castle Clash Duel","招募战士与弓箭手，在瓦片地图上进行双人战术对抗。这个完整 Phaser 原型由 Claude Code 实现，并使用 Pixel Frog 制作的 Tiny Swords 美术素材。","/zh/examples/castle-clash-duel-claude/",{"_26":461,"_28":5402,"_30":5403,"_1183":2718,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5454,"_1168":5455,"_154":5456,"_156":5457,"_39":5458,"_1450":5459,"_1133":5460},[5407,5408,5409,5410,5411,5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426],{"_64":28,"_77":5402,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5403,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":2718,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5454,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5449,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5446,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":