le with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","作者先准备需求文档、技术设计与素材元数据，再使用三个 Claude Code 技能实现 Phaser 玩法、地图和前端测试。美术是另行署名的人工作品；当前项目仍是原型。",[5450,5451,5452,5453],{"_68":5461,"_32":927,"_24":1782},{"_68":5443,"_32":5444,"_24":1151,"_93":5445},{"_68":2034,"_32":5439,"_93":5440,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":927,"_93":5436},[1781,1253],"Read the PRD-to-game workflow","example:silent-meridian-codex","Silent Meridian · 静默子午线","调查停在 00:17 的观测站，在“现在”与“回声”之间切换，借助日志与可选提示，解开四章中的十三道关联谜题。","/zh/examples/silent-meridian-codex/",{"_26":459,"_28":5463,"_30":5464,"_1183":5519,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5518,"_1168":5520,"_154":5521,"_156":5522,"_39":5523,"_1450":5524,"_1133":5525},[5469,5470,5471,5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488],"Silent Meridian",{"_64":28,"_77":5463,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5464,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5519,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5518,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5513,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5510,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5505,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5500,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5495,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":5493,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5492,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":931,"_599":5491,"_601":930,"_39":932,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5489},[5490],{"_68":1922,"_32":933},"/GameMap/media/learning/silent-meridian-codex.webp",[2206],[5494],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[5496],{"_68":5497,"_32":5498,"_93":5499},"阅读人类与 AI 的分工记录","https://github.com/stackloomdev/silent-meridian/blob/main/docs/CREATION.md","Creator-published model roles, iterative workflow and validation limits. It explicitly describes point-and-click scenes rather than a freely walkable 3D world.",[5501],{"_68":5502,"_32":5503,"_93":5504},"查看完整解谜游戏项目","https://github.com/stackloomdev/silent-meridian","Includes all puzzle logic, chapters, illustrations, local saves, audio, tests and design notes. Node.js 22; npm run dev. No backend, API key, CDN or runtime dependencies.",[5506],{"_68":5507,"_32":5508,"_93":5509},"Play Silent Meridian","https://silent-meridian.pjstack.dev/","English and Chinese; mouse, touch and keyboard. Click objects to investigate; Space changes time, J opens the journal, and Esc closes dialogs. Optional WebGL depth has an illustrated fallback.",[5511],{"_68":5512,"_32":5498,"_93":-7},"阅读创作记录",[5514,5515,5516,5517],"Start the opening chapter and compare the two time states.","Read the creation record and art provenance.","Inspect puzzle rules separately from presentation code.","Modify one clue and verify uniqueness, hints and saved progress.","stackloomdev 指导 Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮参与故事、谜题、中英文文案、界面、代码、存档、程序化 WebGL 效果和测试。背景插画另外生成，3D 层为场景调查界面增加景深。","Custom JavaScript · DOM/CSS · WebGL · Web Audio",[5514,5515,5516,5517],{"_68":5528,"_32":5498,"_24":1782},{"_68":5507,"_32":5508,"_24":1151,"_93":5509},{"_68":5527,"_32":5503,"_1489":1490,"_93":5504},{"_68":5526,"_32":5498,"_93":5499},[1314],"Read the human and AI contribution record","Open the complete puzzle-game project","Read the creation record","example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","用挡板引导不断加速的小球，挑战十个难度递增的打砖块关卡，包含多段耐久砖块与本地高分记录。","/zh/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/",{"_26":457,"_28":5530,"_30":5531,"_1183":5582,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5581,"_1168":5583,"_15