ot required for play.",[5569],{"_68":5570,"_32":5571,"_93":5572},"Download morBreaker for Windows or WebGL","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker/releases/tag/v1.2.0","Version 1.2.0 includes Windows standalone and WebGL ZIPs. Extract the Windows build and launch it, or serve the WebGL build over HTTP. A/D or arrows move, Space launches, H shows scores, and Space/Enter restarts. Pointer/touch controls are included; no public hosted play link is supplied.",[5574],{"_68":5575,"_32":5562,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 Unity 与 Claude Code 开发记录",[5577,5578,5579,5580],"Download the Windows release or serve the published WebGL build over HTTP.","Try paddle steering, acceleration, loss, restart, and the local score list.","Read the creator’s Claude Code disclosure and inspect the gameplay C# scripts.","Open SampleScene.unity with Unity 6000.4.11f1, change one level rule, and test progression.","KingMordas 说明几乎整个游戏由 Claude Code 通过 Unity MCP 插件完成，包括玩法脚本、场景与预制体连接、测试及文档。AI 编辑工具与发布游戏的运行环境相互独立。","Unity 6 · URP · C#",[5577,5578,5579,5580],{"_68":5591,"_32":5562,"_24":1468},{"_68":5570,"_32":5571,"_24":1460,"_93":5572},{"_68":5590,"_32":937,"_1489":1490,"_93":5567},{"_68":5589,"_32":5562,"_93":5563},[4498,1781],"Read the explicit Claude Code contribution breakdown","Open the complete Unity game","Read the creator’s Unity and Claude Code account","example:deep-yellow-claude","DEEP YELLOW","在程序生成的后室中探索。这是一款第一人称回合制 Roguelike：移动或等待会触发战斗，装备组合与理智值共同影响每次冒险。","/zh/examples/deep-yellow-claude/",{"_26":455,"_28":5593,"_30":5594,"_1183":2166,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":5651,"_1168":5652,"_154":5653,"_156":5654,"_39":5655,"_1450":5656,"_1133":5657,"_2148":5658},[5598,5599,5600,5601,5602,5603,5604,5605,5606,5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618],{"_64":28,"_77":5593,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5594,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":2166,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_6