 builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.",[5640],{"_68":5641,"_32":941,"_93":5642},"Play DEEP YELLOW","In-development browser build plus Windows/Linux downloads. The creator recommends Chrome or a controller; Firefox mouse input has known problems. Includes horror themes and an interactive tutorial.",[5644],{"_68":5645,"_32":941,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的游戏与开发笔记",[5647,5648,5649,5650],"Play the interactive tutorial and compare moving, waiting, equipment, and sanity.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure and the project’s separate attribution file.","Import project.godot in Godot 4.6 and inspect the start menu, procedural levels, and turn systems.","Change one equipment or turn rule, then test a complete run and restart.","Drew Brereton 明确说明游戏代码由 Claude 辅助开发。项目署名进一步指出使用了 Claude Code，并将原创内容与外部着色器、纹理和字体分开列出。",[5647,5648,5649,5650],{"_68":5662,"_32":941,"_24":1782},{"_68":5641,"_32":941,"_24":1151,"_93":5642},{"_68":2102,"_32":5633,"_1489":1490,"_93":5634},{"_68":5661,"_32":5629,"_93":5630},[1189,1781],[5659],{"_2175":1951,"_32":5637,"_24":1460,"_93":5660},"Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.","Read the explicit Claude Code credit","Read the creator’s game and development notes","example:surge-for-oinja-codex","SURGE for Oinja","在两张可互动地图中对抗机械怪潮，组合电气能力形成构筑。攻击自动发动，玩家负责移动、闪避、选择升级和恢复设施。","/zh/examples/surge-for-oinja-codex/",{"_26":453,"_28":5664,"_30":5665,"_1183":5718,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":5717,"_1168":5719,"_154":5720,"_156":5721,"_39":5722,"_1450":5723,"_1133":5724},[5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686,5687,5688],{"_64":28,"_77":5664,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5665,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5718,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68