 attacks.","Read the creator’s contribution disclosure.","Inspect combat, progression and map code under src/surge/.","Change one ability combination and check its effect during a new run.","Olivia 使用 Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 实现战斗、能力联动、程序化环境、界面和调试。原创 Oinja 世界、创作方向和试玩反馈由作者提供；作品经过多轮会话和修改。","Three.js · Rapier 3D · TypeScript",[5713,5714,5715,5716],{"_68":2035,"_32":946,"_24":1468},{"_68":5707,"_32":5708,"_24":1151,"_93":5709},{"_68":5726,"_32":5703,"_1489":1490,"_93":5704},{"_68":5725,"_32":946,"_93":5699},[1314,1488],"Read the creator’s Codex contribution statement","Open the complete survival-game project","example:project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","受《失落的世界》启发的第一人称野外摄影探险：为史前动物取景，分配四张感光板，避开威胁，并在天色变暗前返回营地。","/zh/examples/project-plateau/",{"_26":451,"_28":5728,"_30":5729,"_1183":5785,"_3423":5786,"_1180":152,"_1175":5783,"_1168":5787,"_154":5788,"_156":5789,"_39":5790,"_1450":5791,"_1133":5792,"_141":1480},[5733,5734,5735,5736,5737,5738,5739,5740,5741,5742,5743,5744,5745,5746,5747,5748,5749,5750,5751,5752,5753],{"_64":28,"_77":5728,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5729,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5785,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":5784,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5783,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5778,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5775,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5770,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5765,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5760,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_6