、已提交的模型纹理、资产生成脚本及一条测试路径的输入记录，没有明确指出具体编码客户端。",[1138],"Three.js · WebGL2",[1138],[5779,5780,5781,5782],{"_68":5795,"_32":5768,"_24":1782},{"_68":5772,"_32":5773,"_24":1151,"_93":5774},{"_68":5794,"_32":5768,"_93":5769,"_1489":1490},{"_68":5793,"_32":5763,"_93":5764},[1488],"Read the creator’s adaptation and QA account","Open the full expedition project","Read the expedition build and design workspace","example:isocity-cursor","IsoCity","用分区、道路、铁路和公共设施建造一座等距城市，观察人口与交通模拟。IsoCity 是完整的 Canvas 浏览器游戏，作者明确表示使用 Cursor 开发。","/zh/examples/isocity-cursor/",{"_26":449,"_28":5797,"_30":5798,"_1183":4925,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":5843,"_1168":5844,"_154":5845,"_156":5846,"_39":5847,"_1450":5848,"_1133":5849},[5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819,5820],{"_64":28,"_77":5797,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":5798,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":4925,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5843,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5838,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":5836,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":5831,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":5828,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":5825,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":5824,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":955,"_599":5823,"_601":954,"_39":888,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":5821},[5822],{"_68":1922,"_32":956},"/GameMap/media/learning/isocity-cursor.webp",[1809],[5826],{"_68":4471,"_32":888,"_93":5827},"Author README presents both IsoCity and IsoCoaster together and directly names Cursor. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[5829],{"_68":2010,"_32":4910,"_93":5830},"Complete Next.js/TypeScript game with renderer, simulation, UI and public assets; npm install then npm run dev opens the city at localhost:3000. Current package uses Next 16; use a compatible current Node runtime. MIT code.",[5832],{"_68":5833,"_32":5834,"_93":5835},"Play IsoCity","https://iso-city.com","Author-hosted browser city builder with pointer and touch support.",[5837],{"_68":4484,"_32":888,"_93":-7},[5839,5840,5841,5842],"Play the city builder and follow how roads, zoning and utilities affect growth.","Run the repository locally and locate the CanvasIsometricGrid renderer and city state.","Trace one system, such as train routing, pedestrian paths or the economy, from input to visible behavior.","Change one simulation rule with an agent, then compare its behavior and save/load flow with the original.","作者明确将 Cursor 列为开发工具，但没有公开模型名称、代码生成比例或完整提示记录。可以把它作为 AI 辅助城市建造项目，研究渲染、状态与模拟之间的衔接。",[5839,5840,5841,5842],{"_68":4500,"_32":888,"_24":1468},{"_68":5833,"_32":5834,"_24":1151,"_93":5835},{"_68":2034,"_32":4910,"_93":5830,"_1489":1490},{"_68":4499,"_32":888,"_93":5827},[],"example:butch-graves-j2me","Butch Graves 3D","在五个万圣节射击篇章中挑战首领、寻找钥匙与秘密，观看游戏内过场。作品使用为 Java 功能手机制作的小型光线投射引擎。","/zh/examples/butch-graves-j2me/",{"_26":447,"_28":5851,"_30":5852,"_1183":5903,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":5902,"_1168":5904,"_154":5905,"_156":5906,"_39":5907,"_1450":5908,"_1133":5909},[5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874],{"_64":28,"_77":5851,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5852,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5903,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,