es,5 fires,0 uses,7/9 switches weapons,# jumps and* opens the map. Binary downloaded and inspected, but not executed.","成品下载",[5895],{"_68":5896,"_32":960,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的开发与测试记录",[5898,5899,5900,5901],"Download the full or lite JAR and open it in a compatible J2ME emulator or MIDP 2.0 phone.","Try moving, turning, firing, using doors and switching weapons during the opening episode.","Read the creator’s implementation account and compare src/E.java with the generated resource packs.","Change one level or resource, follow DEVELOPER.md to rebuild, and verify the phone API, memory and audio constraints on the target runtime.","WollyMonjac 将代码、关卡、美术和音频工具归功于 Claude Opus 5.5。人类提供创作任务与方向，试玩构建并反馈问题；作者也分别说明了桌面模拟、手机模拟器与真机测试的边界。","Custom fixed-point raycaster · Java MIDP 2.0 / CLDC 1.0",[5898,5899,5900,5901],{"_68":5913,"_32":960,"_24":1782},{"_68":5912,"_32":5891,"_24":1460,"_93":5892},{"_68":5911,"_32":960,"_1489":1490,"_93":5887},{"_68":5910,"_32":5882,"_93":5883},[],"Read the human and Claude contribution disclosure","Open the complete J2ME game and assets","Download Butch Graves 3D","Read the creator’s build and testing account","example:pixel-orchard-astra","像素果园 · 记忆收获","翻开十二张种子卡，找出六组相同符号。记录步数、记住翻错的卡牌，然后重新洗牌进行下一轮。","/zh/examples/pixel-orchard-astra/",{"_26":445,"_28":5915,"_30":5916,"_1183":5964,"_1180":151,"_141":2298,"_1175":5963,"_1168":5965,"_154":5966,"_156":5967,"_39":5968,"_1450":5969,"_1133":5970},[5921,5922,5923,5924,5925,5926,5927,5928,5929,5930,5931,5932,5933,5934,5935,5936,5937,5938],"Pixel Orchard · Memory Harvest",{"_64":28,"_77":5915,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":5916,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":5964,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":5963,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":5958,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_7