"_93":6076},"试玩 THUNDERFALL","https://thunderfall.vercel.app/","Chinese interface; keyboard, mouse drag and touch. Attacks fire automatically. WASD/arrows move, Space uses a bomb, E triggers a charged burst, and P/Esc pauses. Full campaign or single-stage practice.",[6078],{"_68":6079,"_32":6080,"_93":-7},"阅读原始需求与开发记录","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/blob/main/works/thunderfall/PROMPT.md",[6082,6083,6084,6085],"Choose a fighter and start the opening sector.","Read the original request separately from the reconstructed reuse specification.","Inspect the game engine, procedural airframes and rendering modules.","Change one bullet pattern and test bombs, pause and a stage transition.","作者公开了实际需求，并报告 GPT-6 Astra ultra 参与设计、实现、程序画面、合成声音和审阅。作品经过协作代理及多轮修改，公开材料未明确说明使用的编码客户端。","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · Web Audio",[6082,6083,6084,6085],{"_68":6096,"_32":6080,"_24":2773},{"_68":6095,"_32":6075,"_24":1151,"_93":6076},{"_68":2034,"_32":6070,"_1489":1490,"_93":6071},{"_68":6094,"_32":6066,"_93":6067},[],"Read the author-published model participation record","Play THUNDERFALL","Read the original request and development record","example:nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home：小螃蟹的日常","照顾住在程序化小屋里的螃蟹 Nagi：放食物、扔球、邀请它使用家具，并从日记观察每日需求变化。这个安静的生活模拟器会保存进度。","/zh/examples/nagi-home-cowork/",{"_26":439,"_28":6098,"_30":6099,"_1183":6149,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6148,"_1168":6150,"_154":6151,"_156":6152,"_39":6153,"_1450":6154,"_1133":6155},[6104,6105,6106,6107,6108,6109,6110,6111,6112,6113,6114,6115,6116,6117,6118,6119,6120,6121,6122],"Nagi Home",{"_64":28,"_77":6098,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6099,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6149,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6148,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6143,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6140,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6136,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6132,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6128,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6126,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6124,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":977,"_599":6123,"_601":976,"_39":978,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/nagi-home-cowork.webp",[6125],"Claude Cowork",[6127],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[6129],{"_68":4471,"_32":6130,"_93":6131},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home#readme","README credits explicitly name Claude Cowork and Claude Opus 5.5, with human planning/publishing attribution.",[6133],{"_68":2010,"_32":6134,"_93":6135},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home","Complete single-file HTML with procedural Three.js scene, need/activity systems, dialogue and localStorage saves; MIT code. Three.js r169 is loaded from jsDelivr and fonts from Google Fonts, so a clean run requires those network resources. No coding-agent subscription is needed to play.",[6137],{"_68":6138,"_32":978,"_93":6139},"试玩 Nagi Home","Japanese interface. Drag to orbit, wheel/pinch to zoom; the food and ball buttons trigger interactions. Normal food placement and ball throwing were checked in Chrome, including diary feedback. This is a life simulation without a combat or level-completion goal.",[6141],{"_68":6142,"_32":6130,"_93":-7},"查看作者的 Cowork 使用与模拟系统说明",[6144,6145,6146,6147],"Place food or throw the ball, then watch Nagi’s activity and diary change.","Read the single index.html to follow daily needs, activity selection, Three.js models and localStorage persistence.","Serve the repository with a static HTTP server or open its HTML in a browser; Three.js and fonts are fetched from external CDNs.","Change one need or activity rule, then check its effect at normal and accelerated time speeds.","作者明确说明，代码由 Claude Cowork 中的 Claude Opus 5.5 生成，并另行注明人类负责企划与发布。这里保留实际客户端 Cowork，不将其改写为 Claude Code；作者没有公开完整对话。","Three.js r169 · JavaScript",[6144,6145,6146,6147],{"_68":6157,"_32":6130,"_24":1468},{"_68":6156,"_32":978,"_24":1151,"_93":6139},{"_68":2034,"_32":6134,"_1489":1490,"_93":6135},{"_68":4499,"_32":6130,"_93":6131},[1488],"Play Nagi Home","Read the creator’s Cowork and simulation notes","example:clockout-unseen-codex","准点下班，别被发现","在三层办公室中限时潜行，利用家具遮挡、咖啡机干扰和临时文件夹伪装避开巡逻视线，抵达电梯下班。","/zh/examples/clockout-unseen-codex/",{"_26":437,"_28":6159,"_30":6160,"_1183":6209,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6208,"_1168":6210,"_154":6211,"_156":6212,"_39":6213,"_1450":6214,"_1133":6215},[6165,6166,6167,6168,6169,6170,6171,6172,6173,6174,6175,6176,6177,6178,6179,6180,6181,6182,6183],"Clock Out Unseen",{"_64":28,"_77":6159,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6160,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6209,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6208,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6203,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6201,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6197,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6193,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6188,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6186,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6185,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":981,"_599":6184,"_601":980,"_39":982,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/clockout-unseen-codex.webp",[2206],[6187],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[6189],{"_68":6190,"_32":6191,"_93":6192},"查看 Codex 与人工的贡献说明","https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md","Creator record names GPT-6 Astra in Codex, gives selected requests and distinguishes independently generated artwork from coding-model work.",[6194],{"_68":2010,"_32":6195,"_93":6196},"https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen","Complete React/Canvas source, maps, original office/character PNGs, tests and Vite configuration. Run npm ci then npm run dev. No runtime AI key. README labels current source V2; verify hosted-version differences before comparing features.",[6198],{"_68":6199,"_32":982,"_93":6200},"试玩 Clock Out Unseen","Chinese interface on Bilibili Toy. Wait for scene assets, then start a level. WASD/arrows move, E interacts and Space uses a folder disguise; mobile joystick/buttons are supplied. The game opened and started without sign-in.",[6202],{"_68":2020,"_32":6191,"_93":-7},[6204,6205,6206,6207],"Start Normal mode and move behind office furniture.","Read the selected prompts and model contribution record.","Trace movement, line-of-sight and disguise rules in the engine.","Change one patrol rule and check immediate detection, retry and level progression.","Ryan-fm 提出办公室潜行概念并确认视觉方向。Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮实现碰撞、视线、巡逻、互动、关卡衔接、手机操作和测试；办公室与人物图片由独立图像生成工具制作。","Canvas 2D · React UI",[6204,6205,6206,6207],{"_68":6218,"_32":6191,"_24":1782},{"_68":6217,"_32":982,"_24":1151,"_93":6200},{"_68":2034,"_32":6195,"_1489":1490,"_93":6196},{"_68":6216,"_32":6191,"_93":6192},[1314],"Read the explicit Codex and human contribution account","Play Clock Out Unseen","Read the creator’s development record","example:fishslop-claude","Fishslop","驾驶潜水器进入沉没的珊瑚礁，喂鱼、收集掉落的硬币，购买新鱼种和潜艇部件。声呐能短暂揭示平时隐形的 Veilfin。","/zh/examples/fishslop-claude/",{"_26":435,"_28":6220,"_30":6221,"_1183":6272,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6271,"_1168":6273,"_154":6274,"_156":6275,"_39":6276,"_1450":6277,"_1133":6278},[6225,6226,6227,6228,6229,6230,6231,6232,6233,6234,6235,6236,6237,6238,6239,6240,6241,6242,6243],{"_64":28,"_77":6220,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6221,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6272,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6271,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6266,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6262,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":6261,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6257,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6253,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6248,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6246,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6245,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":985,"_599":6244,"_601":984,"_39":986,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/fishslop-claude.webp",[1579],[6247],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[6249],{"_68":6250,"_32":6251,"_93":6252},"查看初次实现中的 AI 共同署名","https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5/commit/e7a7a2dd61b6da92f9512ccabafad13e1e9a3df4","Initial game implementation explicitly credits Claude Opus 5.5 as co-author; later fix commits repeat that credit. A model credit alone is not attributed to Claude Code.",[6254],{"_68":2010,"_32":6255,"_93":6256},"https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5","Complete simulation, Three.js renderer, procedural assets, UI, audio, lockfile and tests. npm ci then npm run dev; the README’s Node 20.19+ does not cover every Node 22 version supported by its current Vite 8 dependency, so use Node 22.12+ or another compatible current runtime. No licence file was found; source availability is not a general reuse grant.",[6258],{"_68":6259,"_32":986,"_93":6260},"试玩 Fishslop","WebGL2 with keyboard, mouse or touch. WASD steers, E/Q changes depth, Space feeds, F pings sonar and B opens the dock. The low-quality preset ?quality=low&scale=0.5 was used to check steering, feeding, coin feedback and sonar.","quickstart",[6263],{"_68":6264,"_32":6265,"_93":-7},"查看游戏规则与项目结构","https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5#readme",[6267,6268,6269,6270],"Dive in, steer with WASD, hold Space to feed fish and use F for sonar.","Compare the renderer-free simulation, feeding economy and save parser with the Three.js scene.","Use a Vite-compatible Node runtime, npm ci and npm run dev; Node 22.12+ meets the current Vite 8 requirement.","Change one fish or upgrade value, then check food, dropped coins, dock purchases and saved progress.","作者在初次实现与后续修复的提交中，明确将 Claude Opus 5.5 列为共同作者。这证明模型参与了开发，但未说明具体编码客户端，也不足以认定所有代码均由模型生成。鱼、珊瑚、纹理与音效由游戏代码在运行时生成。","Three.js · TypeScript · Web Audio",[6267,6268,6269,6270],{"_68":6281,"_32":6265,"_24":6261},{"_68":6280,"_32":986,"_24":1151,"_93":6260},{"_68":2034,"_32":6255,"_1489":1490,"_93":6256},{"_68":6279,"_32":6251,"_93":6252},[1488],"Read the initial AI-credited implementation","Play Fishslop","Read the game rules and project structure","example:pelican-bike-claude","Pelican on a Bike：鹈鹕骑单车","让戴着头盔的鹈鹕沿程序化海岸骑行，变道抓鱼、跳跃并解锁小成就。完整 Three.js 工程包含角色、单车、海洋、音频与昼夜系统。","/zh/examples/pelican-bike-claude/",{"_26":433,"_28":6283,"_30":6284,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6333,"_1168":6334,"_154":6335,"_156":6336,"_39":6337,"_1450":6338,"_1133":6339},[6289,6290,6291,6292,6293,6294,6295,6296,6297,6298,6299,6300,6301,6302,6303,6304,6305,6306,6307],"Pelican on a Bike",{"_64":28,"_77":6283,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6284,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6333,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6328,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6325,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":2773,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6321,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6317,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6313,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6310,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6309,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":989,"_599":6308,"_601":988,"_39":990,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/pelican-bike-claude.webp",[1744],[6311,6312],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},[6314],{"_68":4471,"_32":6315,"_93":6316},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo#readme","Creator-published prompt and session summary, with exact Claude Code attribution. The model-led long-run tests described there were not repeated by GameMap.",[6318],{"_68":2010,"_32":6319,"_93":6320},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo/tree/main/pelican-bike","Complete pelican-bike source, build script and procedural assets. Run npm install and node build.mjs in that subdirectory, then open dist/index.html. The repository contains three distinct games; this case selects only the pelican game. Package metadata names ISC, but no repository-wide licence text is supplied.",[6322],{"_68":6323,"_32":990,"_93":6324},"试玩鹈鹕骑单车","Keyboard and touch controls; W/S accelerate/brake, A/D change lanes, Space jumps and C changes camera. A muted entry is available. Desktop launch, acceleration, jump achievement and camera change were checked.",[6326],{"_68":6327,"_32":6315,"_93":-7},"阅读原始提示词与开发记录",[6329,6330,6331,6332],"Start a muted ride, accelerate with W/S, change lanes with A/D and jump with Space.","Compare the published one-sentence prompt with the pelican, bicycle, cloth, ocean and camera modules.","In pelican-bike, install dependencies and run node build.mjs; open the resulting dist/index.html in a browser.","Change one collection or cycling rule, then check movement, jump, score feedback and restart.","作者说明使用 Claude Code 中的 Claude Opus 5.5，从一句中文提示开始生成游戏。README 公开提示词，并记录模型进行浏览器测试及后续修复的过程；“人工未改代码”是作者自述，并非独立测量的创作比例。",[6329,6330,6331,6332],{"_68":6341,"_32":6315,"_24":2773},{"_68":6340,"_32":990,"_24":1151,"_93":6324},{"_68":2034,"_32":6319,"_1489":1490,"_93":6320},{"_68":4499,"_32":6315,"_93":6316},[1781,1488],"Play Pelican on a Bike","Read the original prompt and development account","example:three-kingdoms-codex","三分天下 · 百将风云","经营钱粮、发展城池，在十五座据点间统率武将作战。选择魏、蜀或吴，与两个电脑势力竞争，一统地图。","/zh/examples/three-kingdoms-codex/",{"_26":431,"_28":6343,"_30":6344,"_1183":6398,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6397,"_1168":6399,"_154":6400,"_156":6401,"_39":6402,"_1450":6403,"_1133":6404},[6349,6350,6351,6352,6353,6354,6355,6356,6357,6358,6359,6360,6361,6362,6363,6364,6365,6366,6367,6368],"Three Kingdoms: Hundred Heroes",{"_64":28,"_77":6343,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6344,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6398,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6397,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6392,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6389,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6384,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6380,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6375,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6373,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6372,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":993,"_599":6371,"_601":992,"_39":994,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":6369},[6370],{"_68":1922,"_32":995},"/GameMap/media/learning/three-kingdoms-codex.webp",[2206],[6374],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[6376],{"_68":6377,"_32":6378,"_93":6379},"查看在 Codex 中使用 Astra 的说明","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/blob/main/works/three-kingdoms/CREATION.md","The project initiator’s statement distinguishes human direction, Codex implementation and separately generated bitmap assets. It describes multiple iterations rather than one prompt.",[6381],{"_68":2010,"_32":6382,"_93":6383},"https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/tree/main/works/three-kingdoms","Includes rules, interface, 108 officers, generated terrain and portrait atlases, tests and deployment configuration. Node.js 22.13+; npm ci then npm run dev from works/three-kingdoms. Static export uses dist/client. Repository CC0; dependencies retain their own terms.",[6385],{"_68":6386,"_32":6387,"_93":6388},"试玩三国百将","https://sanguo-jiangshan.vercel.app/","Simplified Chinese interface, mouse/touch controls, no login or API key. Choose a faction and start. Saves and JSON import/export are local to the current browser.",[6390],{"_68":6391,"_32":6378,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的开发贡献记录",[6393,6394,6395,6396],"Choose a faction and inspect a city and its officers.","Read the creation record and portrait provenance.","Execute an economic order and follow its resource and officer effects.","Change one economy or combat rule and test turns, opponents and saves.","MartinDelophy 提出策略游戏方向，要求扩充武将、头像和数值平衡。Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮实现规则、界面、数据、对手、存档和测试；地形与头像图集由独立图像工具生成。","DOM/CSS + SVG · React",[6393,6394,6395,6396],{"_68":6407,"_32":6378,"_24":1782},{"_68":6406,"_32":6387,"_24":1151,"_93":6388},{"_68":2034,"_32":6382,"_1489":1490,"_93":6383},{"_68":6405,"_32":6378,"_93":6379},[1314],"Read the explicit Astra-in-Codex attribution","Play Three Kingdoms","Read the creator’s contribution record","example:fang-fox-gbc-claude","Fang the Fox · Game Boy Color","以真正的 Game Boy Color 游戏形式探索浮空岛、挑战首领、解开谜题，体验小狐狸的冒险。可在浏览器模拟器中试玩，也可下载 ROM 在掌机或模拟器中运行。","/zh/examples/fang-fox-gbc-claude/",{"_26":429,"_28":6409,"_30":6410,"_1183":6466,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6465,"_1168":6467,"_154":6468,"_156":6469,"_39":6470,"_1450":6471,"_1133":6472,"_2148":6473},[6414,6415,6416,6417,6418,6419,6420,6421,6422,6423,6424,6425,6426,6427,6428,6429,6430,6431,6432,6433],{"_64":28,"_77":6409,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6410,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6466,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6465,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6460,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6457,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6453,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":2146,"_70":6448,"_66":2148,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6443,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6438,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6437,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":998,"_599":6436,"_601":997,"_39":999,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":6434},[6435],{"_68":1922,"_32":1000},"/GameMap/media/learning/fang-fox-gbc-claude.webp",[1744],[6439],{"_68":6440,"_32":6441,"_93":6442},"查看 Claude Code 与 Opus 的明确署名","https://tinybitadventures.com/fang-the-fox-on-the-game-boy-color/","First-person creator account names Claude Code with Opus 5.5 and distinguishes generated implementation from the creator’s direction and music listening. Reported automated test totals were not independently reproduced.",[6444],{"_68":6445,"_32":6446,"_93":6447},"打开完整卡带与浏览器项目","https://github.com/TinyBitAdventures/fang-the-fox","The gbc/ C project, generators, music arrangements and web emulator are public. Download the whole repository: gbc/tools/build.js reads ../js data and sprites. Rebuilding requires Node and GBDK-2020 4.5.0; the ready-made ROM needs neither. Code/pixel art are MIT; music is excluded from that license.",[6449],{"_68":6450,"_32":6451,"_93":6452},"GitHub Releases · GBC","https://github.com/TinyBitAdventures/fang-the-fox/releases/tag/gbc-v1.0.0","Download — Game Boy Color ROM and GBC release ZIP. Requires a compatible emulator or cartridge device; the ROM was not executed in this review.",[6454],{"_68":6455,"_32":999,"_93":6456},"试玩 Game Boy Color 版 Fang the Fox","Click Start game, focus the emulator, then press Enter/X to start. Arrow keys move, attack and talk; X is A, Z is B, Enter pauses, and Shift shows the area. Hold keys briefly across emulator frames. The page also offers a 256 KB .gbc ROM for compatible emulators or hardware.",[6458],{"_68":6459,"_32":6441,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 Game Boy 移植过程",[6461,6462,6463,6464],"Start the browser emulator, choose New Game and advance the opening dialogue with X.","Move, interact and inspect the pause map before comparing the cartridge edition with the original browser game.","Read the creator’s porting account and the C implementation under gbc/src/.","Clone the whole repository, then use Node and GBDK-2020 4.5.0 to rebuild through gbc/Makefile; the generator also reads the root JavaScript game data.","Austin Ginder 说明由运行 Opus 5.5 的 Claude Code 将自己的浏览器游戏移植为 C。他提供方向并试听改编音乐；公开构建工具让原版与卡带版共享地图、精灵和规则。","GBDK-2020 4.5 · C / hUGEDriver",[6461,6462,6463,6464],{"_68":6479,"_32":6441,"_24":1782},{"_68":6478,"_32":999,"_24":1151,"_93":6456},{"_68":6477,"_32":6446,"_1489":1490,"_93":6447},{"_68":6476,"_32":6441,"_93":6442},[],[6474],{"_2175":6450,"_32":6451,"_24":1460,"_93":6475},"Game Boy Color ROM and GBC release ZIP. Requires a compatible emulator or cartridge device; the ROM was not executed in this review.","Read the explicit Claude Code and Opus credit","Open the complete cartridge and browser project","Play Fang the Fox for Game Boy Color","Read the creator’s Game Boy porting account","example:vibe-golf-bevy","Vibe Golf","在布满山坡与装饰物的 3D 地形上蓄力击球，追逐移动的鸭子目标，体验小型街机高尔夫沙盒。","/zh/examples/vibe-golf-bevy/",{"_26":427,"_28":6481,"_30":6482,"_1183":6529,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6528,"_1168":6530,"_154":6531,"_156":6532,"_39":6533,"_1450":6534,"_1133":6535},[6486,6487,6488,6489,6490,6491,6492,6493,6494,6495,6496,6497,6498,6499,6500,6501,6502,6503],{"_64":28,"_77":6481,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6482,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6529,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6528,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6523,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6520,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6516,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6511,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6506,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6505,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":1003,"_599":6504,"_601":1002,"_39":1004,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/vibe-golf-bevy.webp",[2335],[6507],{"_68":6508,"_32":6509,"_93":6510},"查看人工与 GPT-5 的贡献说明","https://www.reddit.com/r/ChatGPT/comments/1mnllsq/vibe_coded_a_3d_game_with_gpt_5_and_rust/","First-person creator post links both this source and live build, distinguishes the heightmap from generated assets and describes iterative direction. It does not establish use of Codex or another named coding client.",[6512],{"_68":6513,"_32":6514,"_93":6515},"打开完整 Bevy 游戏源码","https://github.com/ahammer/vibe_golf","Rust game, Cargo setup, terrain/shaders, audio, GLB props and a prebuilt web/ WASM version are public. Cargo.toml uses Bevy0.14 and Rapier0.27; cargo run launches native play. Asset-heavy repository; code license is marked TBD and asset terms are not consolidated.",[6517],{"_68":6518,"_32":1004,"_93":6519},"试玩 Vibe Golf","Small experimental browser golf sandbox. Initial WASM and asset loading can be slow; use a GPU-capable desktop Chrome browser. Click Play, hold/release left mouse to shoot, right-drag to orbit and scroll to zoom. The game currently logs missing optional .meta requests even though the corresponding assets load.",[6521],{"_68":6522,"_32":6509,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 GPT-5 开发记录",[6524,6525,6526,6527],"Wait for the browser build to render, then click Play in the middle of the canvas.","Hold and release the left mouse button to launch the ball; use right-drag to orbit and the wheel to zoom.","Read the creator’s account and compare source plugins for terrain, shooting, physics and game state.","Use a local Rust toolchain to run cargo run, change one shot parameter and test launch, movement and target progression.","作者将几乎全部开发与生成素材描述为 GPT-5 实验，另行提供了自己偏好的高度图，并多次调整设计方向。具体编程客户端未说明；项目公开了实际玩法和渲染源码，而非仅提供提示词。","Bevy 0.14 + Rapier 0.27 · Rust / WebAssembly",[6524,6525,6526,6527],{"_68":6539,"_32":6509,"_24":1468},{"_68":6538,"_32":1004,"_24":1151,"_93":6519},{"_68":6537,"_32":6514,"_1489":1490,"_93":6515},{"_68":6536,"_32":6509,"_93":6510},[],"Read the human and GPT-5 contribution statement","Open the complete Bevy game","Play Vibe Golf","Read the creator’s GPT-5 development account","example:core-business-claude","Core Business","向下钻掘矿物，管理燃料与机体状态，回到地面商店出售矿产和升级。这是受 Motherload 启发的非商业采矿技术演示：Three.js 渲染 2.5D 世界，Blender 脚本制作三维资产。","/zh/examples/core-business-claude/",{"_26":425,"_28":6541,"_30":6542,"_1183":1605,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6591,"_1168":6593,"_154":6594,"_156":6595,"_39":6596,"_1450":6597,"_1133":6598,"_3423":6599},[6546,6547,6548,6549,6550,6551,6552,6553,6554,6555,6556,6557,6558,6559,6560,6561,6562,6563,6564,6565],{"_64":28,"_77":6541,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6542,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":1605,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":6592,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6591,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6586,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6583,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6579,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6575,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6571,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6568,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6567,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":1007,"_599":6566,"_601":1006,"_39":1008,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/core-business-claude.webp",[1579],[6569,6570],{"_68":1444,"_32":1445},{"_68":1138,"_32":1139},[6572],{"_68":4471,"_32":6573,"_93":6574},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business#readme","The author explicitly separates Claude-generated work from ElevenLabs audio and credits Motherload/XGen Studios. This does not imply that Claude created the original game’s rules.",[6576],{"_68":2010,"_32":6577,"_93":6578},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business","Complete JavaScript game, vendored Three.js, committed GLBs, Blender source scripts, UI, audio and tests. Serve the root, e.g. python3 -m http.server 5173; Blender regeneration is unnecessary for normal play. Code is MIT with explicit exceptions: ElevenLabs audio is supplied for this project, not separate extraction or redistribution; see LICENSE.",[6580],{"_68":6581,"_32":1008,"_93":6582},"试玩 Core Business","WebGL browser, keyboard/pointer and touch controls. Initial graphics preparation stalled with the default headless renderer; Chrome with Metal reached normal play. After the opening transmission, brief movement/drilling input produced score 25 and fuel/depth feedback. Full mining progression and audio were not tested.",[6584],{"_68":6585,"_32":6573,"_93":-7},"查看采矿游戏的实现与资产流程",[6587,6588,6589,6590],"Start a new game and learn movement, downward drilling, fuel and return-to-surface shops.","Read the fixed-step simulation separately from the Three.js renderer and committed GLB models.","Serve the repository root with a static HTTP server; opening ES modules via file:// does not work.","Change one mineral or upgrade rule, then check drilling, selling, fuel use and save/reload.","作者将游戏代码、测试、纹理、翻译、模型和 Blender 生成脚本归于 Claude Opus 5.5，音效与音乐来自 ElevenLabs。该项目使用新资产重新实现 Motherload 风格的规则，并明确定位为非商业实验；未说明具体编码客户端。",[1138,3980],[6587,6588,6589,6590],{"_68":6601,"_32":6573,"_24":1782},{"_68":6600,"_32":1008,"_24":1151,"_93":6582},{"_68":2034,"_32":6577,"_1489":1490,"_93":6578},{"_68":4499,"_32":6573,"_93":6574},[1488,1192],[1138,3980],"Play Core Business","Read the mining game’s implementation and asset pipeline","example:eight-second-crew-codex","8 秒盗贼团","录制一段八秒行动，让分身在下一轮重播，与过去的自己合作偷取钥匙并逃脱。九个关卡逐步加入机关踏板、巡逻者和投射物。","/zh/examples/eight-second-crew-codex/",{"_26":423,"_28":6603,"_30":6604,"_1183":6023,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6654,"_1168":6657,"_154":6658,"_156":6659,"_39":6660,"_1450":6661,"_1133":6662,"_3423":6663},[6609,6610,6611,6612,6613,6614,6615,6616,6617,6618,6619,6620,6621,6622,6623,6624,6625,6626,6627,6628],"8-Second Crew · 8초 도둑단",{"_64":28,"_77":6603,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":142,"_77":6604,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6023,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":6655,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6654,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6649,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6646,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":1159,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6642,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6638,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6633,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6631,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6630,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":1011,"_599":6629,"_601":1010,"_39":1012,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp",[2206],[6632],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[6634],{"_68":6635,"_32":6636,"_93":6637},"查看人工与 Codex 的开发分工","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026#codex와-함께-만든-과정","README and the creator’s linked article describe concrete planning, implementation, sprite, QA and deployment work; neither is a complete session transcript.",[6639],{"_68":2010,"_32":6640,"_93":6641},"https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026","Complete static project with modules, nine stages, sprites, fonts, tests and demo recording. Node.js 18+; npm start, with no dependency installation. Code has no explicit license; the bundled Galmuri font uses OFL.",[6643],{"_68":6644,"_32":1012,"_93":6645},"试玩 8-Second Crew","Korean, English and Japanese; keyboard, click-to-move and touch. WASD/arrows move, X records a clone, Z lures guards, and R restarts. Wait through the brief Ready countdown before moving.",[6647],{"_68":6648,"_32":6636,"_93":-7},"阅读作者的 Codex 开发记录",[6650,6651,6652,6653],"Start the first stage and learn movement, keys and exits.","Read the creator’s Codex development account and asset credits.","Press X to record a route, then inspect how the clone replays it.","Change a stage or replay rule and test a complete escape and restart.","DongJae Shin 决定规则、难度和表现方向，Codex 协助规划与实现关卡、碰撞、行动重播、界面、测试和部署。Agent Sprite Forge 处理生成角色的精灵素材，作者反复试玩并提出修改。",[6656],"Agent Sprite Forge",[6650,6651,6652,6653],{"_68":6666,"_32":6636,"_24":1782},{"_68":6665,"_32":1012,"_24":1151,"_93":6645},{"_68":2034,"_32":6640,"_1489":1490,"_93":6641},{"_68":6664,"_32":6636,"_93":6637},[1314],[6656],"Read the author’s human and Codex division of work","Play 8-Second Crew","Read the creator’s Codex build account","example:word-rain-chatgpt","Word Rain","移动篮子，按顺序接住字母拼成单词，同时躲避红色危险方块。护盾、万能字母、完美单词连击和变化的下落速度，让拼字街机不断增加挑战。","/zh/examples/word-rain-chatgpt/",{"_26":571,"_28":6668,"_30":6669,"_1183":6728,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6727,"_1168":6722,"_154":6729,"_156":6730,"_39":6731,"_1450":6732,"_1133":6733,"_2148":6734},[6673,6674,6675,6676,6677,6678,6679,6680,6681,6682,6683,6684,6685,6686,6687,6688,6689,6690,6691,6692],{"_64":28,"_77":6668,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6669,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6728,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6727,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6722,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6718,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":6261,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6714,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":2146,"_70":6707,"_66":2148,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6702,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6697,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6695,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6694,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":670,"_599":6693,"_601":669,"_39":671,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/word-rain-chatgpt.webp",[2132,2206],[6696],{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[6698],{"_68":6699,"_32":6700,"_93":6701},"Read the author’s ChatGPT/Codex disclosure","https://octopuskid.itch.io/word-rain","The author explicitly credits ChatGPT/Codex for code and interface text, retaining design and refinement. The repository also links a behind-the-scenes development video. No exact model version is specified.",[6703],{"_68":6704,"_32":6705,"_93":6706},"Open the complete browser and Android project","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain","Complete index.html, game handwriting font, bundled recordings and audio credits, plus Android Java/WebView source and packaging scripts. Open the HTML with assets/music intact; the original generated tune works without those two recordings. Code, original font, tune and synthesized effects are MIT; Kevin MacLeod recordings are CC BY 4.0. See android/README.md for Android builds.",[6708,6709],{"_68":6712,"_32":671,"_93":6713},{"_68":1951,"_32":6710,"_93":6711},"https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain/releases/tag/v1.5.3","Download — Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","GitHub Pages","Browser play — Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.",[6715],{"_68":6716,"_32":6700,"_93":6717},"Play Word Rain on itch.io","Free browser game with keyboard, drag and touch controls; an alternative browser build is linked on GitHub Pages. The store and GitHub Releases also offer Full/Lite Android APKs and an offline Lite HTML ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Browser start, moving letters and basket controls were checked; APK installation and a complete scoring run were not tested.",[6719],{"_68":6720,"_32":6721,"_93":-7},"Read the creator’s source and run guide","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain#run-the-game",[6723,6724,6725,6726],"启动网页游戏，用方向键、A/D 或拖动操作篮子。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，对比浏览器和 Android 版本。","保留 assets/music 目录打开 index.html，或下载独立 Lite 版本在离线浏览器运行。","在 Canvas 游戏中跟踪字母生成、接取、护盾和计分逻辑，修改规则前检查暂停与继续。","octopuskid 负责设计和打磨，ChatGPT/Codex 辅助代码及界面文本。原创旋律与音效通过代码合成，也有 ChatGPT 协助；两首可选 Kevin MacLeod 录音单独署名，并非 AI 生成音乐。","Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM/CSS UI",{"_68":6720,"_32":6721,"_24":6261},{"_68":6716,"_32":6700,"_24":1151,"_93":6717},{"_68":6704,"_32":6705,"_1489":1490,"_93":6706},{"_68":6699,"_32":6700,"_93":6701},[1314],[6735,6736],{"_2175":6712,"_32":671,"_24":1151,"_93":6738},{"_2175":1951,"_32":6710,"_24":1460,"_93":6737},"Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.","example:minimal-rogue-claude","Minimal Rogue","探索黑白地牢、打碎方块，管理体力和装备，逐层深入 ASCII 风格的肉鸽冒险。游戏提供英文和日文界面。","/zh/examples/minimal-rogue-claude/",{"_26":575,"_28":6740,"_30":6741,"_1183":6023,"_1180":151,"_141":2298,"_1175":6788,"_1168":6783,"_154":6789,"_156":6790,"_39":6791,"_1450":6792,"_1133":6793},[6745,6746,6747,6748,6749,6750,6751,6752,6753,6754,6755,6756,6757,6758,6759,6760,6761,6762,6763],{"_64":28,"_77":6740,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6741,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6023,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":2297,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6788,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6783,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6780,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1468,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6776,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6772,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6768,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6766,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6765,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":661,"_599":6764,"_601":660,"_39":662,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/minimal-rogue-claude.webp",[1744],[6767],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},[6769],{"_68":6770,"_32":662,"_93":6771},"Read the author’s Claude Code and SUNO attribution","The creator identifies Claude Code for development, SUNO AI for music, links the complete repository and explicitly describes the work as created entirely using AI. No model version or full development transcript is supplied.",[6773],{"_68":2010,"_32":6774,"_93":6775},"https://github.com/HirotakaAdachi/Rogue/tree/anonymous-release","Complete static HTML/CSS/JavaScript project and four MP3 tracks; serve the root over HTTP without a package install or build step. MIT code license is included; SUNO music is credited without a separate music license. The reviewed public source index references script version 549, while the itch build references 581, so the two releases are not claimed to be byte-identical.",[6777],{"_68":6778,"_32":662,"_93":6779},"Play Minimal Rogue on itch.io","Browser keyboard game. Enter confirms the opening and tutorial; arrows move, Space defends, and X opens the menu. A short first-floor run verified movement, block-cracking feedback and the command menu. Later floors, saves and a complete run were not tested.",[6781],{"_68":6782,"_32":662,"_93":-7},"Read the creator’s AI and source-code notes",[6784,6785,6786,6787],"运行网页游戏，选择新游戏与语言，用 Enter 推进开场和教程。","用方向键探索首个房间，Space 防御，X 打开指令菜单。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，检查完整 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 和音乐文件。","通过 HTTP 提供源码目录，修改一项房间或体力规则，检查移动、交互和新一局流程。","Hirotaka Adachi 将开发工具归为 Claude Code，音乐归为 SUNO AI，并称作品完全由 AI 制作，但没有给出确切编程模型。公开项目包含渲染器、规则、界面和四首音乐；作者的这一表述不等于没有人工指导的自主开发。",{"_68":6782,"_32":662,"_24":1468},{"_68":6778,"_32":662,"_24":1151,"_93":6779},{"_68":2034,"_32":6774,"_1489":1490,"_93":6775},{"_68":6770,"_32":662,"_93":6771},[1781],"example:polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","在冰面 3D 场景中滑行，用三段近战连击向前推进，射击时利用后坐力向后移动。穿过闸门、收集金币，在短篇 Game Jam 冒险中对抗老鼠政权。","/zh/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/",{"_26":579,"_28":6795,"_30":6796,"_1183":6850,"_1180":152,"_141":1480,"_1175":6846,"_3423":6851,"_1168":6841,"_154":6852,"_156":6853,"_39":6854,"_1450":6855,"_1133":6856},[6800,6801,6802,6803,6804,6805,6806,6807,6808,6809,6810,6811,6812,6813,6814,6815,6816,6817,6818,6819],{"_64":28,"_77":6795,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6796,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6850,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":6847,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":112,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6846,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6841,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6838,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6834,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6830,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6826,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6822,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6821,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":647,"_599":6820,"_601":646,"_39":648,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1518},{"_64":74,"_66":1430,"_68":1431,"_77":102,"_79":80},"/GameMap/media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp",[1744],[6823,6824,6825],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},{"_68":1144,"_32":1145},{"_68":1138,"_32":1139},[6827],{"_68":6828,"_32":648,"_93":6829},"Read the team’s explicit Claude Code assistance statement","The creators distinguish AI help with diagnosing and implementing core code from their own code review, modeling, animation and art. The page links the full game source and identifies Godot 4.6 and GDScript; its “No generative AI” content badge does not erase the separate coding-assistance disclosure.",[6831],{"_68":3959,"_32":6832,"_93":6833},"https://github.com/afenkurtz/Big-Mode-Game-Jam-2026/tree/main/slick","Complete Godot 4.6 project with levels, GDScript, GLB/FBX models, Blender authoring files, textures, UI and audio. The inspected tree has 292 files, about 239 MB. Open the slick folder; importing Blender authoring files may require a compatible Blender installation. No top-level game license was found; external sounds, music and fonts retain their separately credited terms.",[6835],{"_68":6836,"_32":648,"_93":6837},"Play or download Polar Icecapade on itch.io","Mouse recommended: left-click performs melee propulsion, right-click shoots with recoil, and Escape pauses. Browser review reached the first level, moved, fired a projectile with ammo changing from 12 to 11, and opened pause. The roughly 170 MB web build has author-documented performance limits; Windows/Linux downloads are provided and mobile is not recommended. Later levels and a complete run were not tested.",[6839],{"_68":6840,"_32":648,"_93":-7},"Read the team’s development and asset breakdown",[6842,6843,6844,6845],"使用鼠标开始网页首关，测试冰面滑行和近战连击推进。","右键射击，对比向后的后坐力与近战向前推进。","阅读团队对 Claude Code 的说明，以及人工美术、动画和音频署名。","在 Godot 4.6 中打开 slick 工程，修改一项移动或闸门规则，检查首个房间、弹药、暂停与重开。","Aidan “Botodo” Connolly 和 Evan Kurtz 说明 Claude Code 帮助诊断问题、实现困难的核心逻辑，之后他们检查并调整了全部代码。建模、绑定、动画和设计由团队完成，音频另有署名；作者明确说明没有用生成式 AI 制作资产，也未给出编程模型版本。",[1138,6848,6849],"Procreate","Affinity","Godot 4.6 · GDScript · 3D",[1138,6848,6849],{"_68":6840,"_32":648,"_24":1782},{"_68":6836,"_32":648,"_24":1151,"_93":6837},{"_68":3959,"_32":6832,"_1489":1490,"_93":6833},{"_68":6828,"_32":648,"_93":6829},[1781,1189,1192],"example:overexposed-ai","Overexposed","通过卡牌选择，引导一位初露头角的艺人度过一年的职业生涯。平衡技艺、金钱和关注度，观察三家报纸的反应，避免过高热度引发丑闻。","/zh/examples/overexposed-ai/",{"_26":573,"_28":6858,"_30":6859,"_1183":6916,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6913,"_1168":6908,"_154":6917,"_156":6918,"_39":6919,"_1450":6920,"_1133":6921,"_3423":6922},[6863,6864,6865,6866,6867,6868,6869,6870,6871,6872,6873,6874,6875,6876,6877,6878,6879,6880,6881,6882,6883],{"_64":28,"_77":6858,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6859,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6916,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":6914,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6913,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6908,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6904,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":6261,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6900,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6895,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6891,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6888,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6887,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":665,"_599":6886,"_601":664,"_39":666,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":6884},[6885],{"_68":1922,"_32":667},"/GameMap/media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp",[1744,2206],[6889,6890],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},{"_68":1283,"_32":1284},[6892],{"_68":6893,"_32":666,"_93":6894},"Read the creator’s AI contribution and asset disclosure","The author names Claude Code and OpenAI Codex and explains human editing of text. README confirms AI-assisted commits with Co-Authored-By trailers; CREDITS.md explains procedural pictures/effects and the separate music/font sources.",[6896],{"_68":6897,"_32":6898,"_93":6899},"Open the complete career-simulation project","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed","Complete TypeScript/React project with the rule engine, content, UI drawings, procedural sound, six music files, fonts, balance simulator and browser checks. Node.js >=22.18; npm install, npm run dev or npm run build. No explicit software license is provided, so public source availability does not establish reuse rights. Bundled fonts are OFL 1.1 and Holizna music is CC0; see CREDITS.md.",[6901],{"_68":6902,"_32":666,"_93":6903},"Play Overexposed on itch.io","Browser playtest build, best on a landscape desktop screen. Uses mouse or touch; cards show effects on hover or long press. Begin, opening text and manager choice reached the live card desk in Chrome. The complete year, all endings and touch play were not tested; the hosted build is not claimed to match the latest repository revision.",[6905],{"_68":6906,"_32":6907,"_93":-7},"Read the game’s source and local run commands","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed#readme",[6909,6910,6911,6912],"打开 itch.io 网页版本，依次选择 Begin、Continue 并签约经纪人。","选择开局卡牌，观察桌面、资源和报纸如何回应。","阅读作者 AI 披露、README 和 CREDITS.md，区分程序化美术、音效与第三方音乐。","使用 Node.js 22.18+ 执行 npm install、npm run dev，沿 content/cards.json、core/reducer.ts 和 React 桌面阅读规则，再测试一整年。","EG30 负责设计、方向和写作，使用 Claude Code 与 OpenAI Codex 实现游戏，并亲自修改 AI 辅助起草的文本。美术和音效通过代码绘制或合成；Holizna 背景音乐另有 CC0 署名。",[6915],"Canvas 2D (procedural halftone art)","DOM/CSS + SVG · React UI",{"_68":6906,"_32":6907,"_24":6261},{"_68":6902,"_32":666,"_24":1151,"_93":6903},{"_68":6897,"_32":6898,"_1489":1490,"_93":6899},{"_68":6893,"_32":666,"_93":6894},[1781,1314],[6915],"example:katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","选择狐妖剑士，在等距视角的动作肉鸽中迎战妖怪、管理体力、拾取道具并深入地牢。这个无声原型支持本地多人，当前源码还记录了后续队伍系统。","/zh/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/",{"_26":577,"_28":6924,"_30":6925,"_1183":6990,"_1180":151,"_141":1480,"_1175":6984,"_3423":6991,"_1168":6979,"_154":6992,"_156":6993,"_39":6994,"_1450":6995,"_1133":6996},[6929,6930,6931,6932,6933,6934,6935,6936,6937,6938,6939,6940,6941,6942,6943,6944,6945,6946,6947,6948,6949],{"_64":28,"_77":6924,"_66":28,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":142,"_77":6925,"_66":30,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1181,"_77":6990,"_66":1183,"_84":136,"_79":80},{"_64":105,"_68":3421,"_107":108,"_70":6985,"_66":3423,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1179,"_77":111,"_66":1180,"_84":104,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1176,"_77":1478,"_66":141,"_84":1178,"_79":42},{"_64":74,"_68":1173,"_77":6984,"_66":1175,"_84":136,"_79":42},{"_64":105,"_68":1165,"_107":1166,"_70":6979,"_66":1168,"_84":-7,"_79":42},{"_64":65,"_68":1160,"_70":6975,"_66":154,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1467,"_77":1763,"_66":154,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":74,"_68":1158,"_77":299,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1152,"_70":6971,"_66":156,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":81,"_77":1151,"_66":156,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":130,"_70":6967,"_66":39,"_84":-7},{"_64":74,"_68":1454,"_77":1455,"_66":39,"_84":-7,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_68":1448,"_70":6962,"_66":1450,"_84":-7},{"_64":65,"_68":1131,"_70":6954,"_66":1133,"_84":-7},{"_64":105,"_66":1437,"_68":1438,"_70":6953,"_79":80},{"_64":1432,"_66":1433,"_68":653,"_599":6952,"_601":652,"_39":654,"_609":610,"_611":612,"_1435":1928},{"_64":74,"_66":1925,"_68":1926,"_77":102,"_79":80},{"_64":65,"_66":1921,"_68":1922,"_70":6950},[6951],{"_68":1922,"_32":656},"/GameMap/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp",[1744,1930],[6955,6956,6957,6958,6959],{"_68":1744,"_32":1748},{"_68":1144,"_32":1145},{"_68":2272,"_32":2273},{"_68":6960,"_32":6961},{"_68":1138,"_32":1139},"Meshy API","/zh/resources/meshy/",[6963],{"_68":6964,"_32":6965,"_93":6966},"Read the creator’s AI production disclosure","https://9-k9.itch.io/katanakitsune","The author explicitly names Claude Code and GitHub Copilot alongside image, sprite and 3D asset tools, and links the primary complete source repository. The README verifies the Godot version and explains which finished assets are included.",[6968],{"_68":3959,"_32":6969,"_93":6970},"https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune","Godot 4.7 project with scenes, GDScript, Dialogic addon and finished sprite assets. The inspected tree contains about 383 MB of files; no top-level game license was found. The upstream Meshy/Blender/PixelOver authoring pipeline is separate, while its finished runtime sprites are committed. The current source contains newer party/asset changes than the reviewed hosted prototype.",[6972],{"_68":6973,"_32":6965,"_93":6974},"Play Katana Kitsune on itch.io","Silent HTML5 prototype with keyboard and gamepad support. Space confirms player/device choices; allow a clear press and release between setup steps. The browser build loaded and reached player/device selection in review; combat and a complete dungeon run were not exercised. The download is large: about 184 MB of game data plus 40 MB of WebAssembly.",[6976],{"_68":6977,"_32":6978,"_93":-7},"Read the game and asset-pipeline documentation","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune#readme",[6980,6981,6982,6983],"打开 itch 原型，选择一名真人玩家，认领键盘并选择服装。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，以及角色、战斗和精灵制作流程说明。","在 Godot 4.7 中通过 GL Compatibility 打开 project.godot；工程已包含可运行精灵和游戏场景。","调整一项战斗或生成参数，检查标题、选角、地牢、受伤和重开的完整衔接。","作者明确列出 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、GPT Image 2、PixelLab 和 Meshy 等制作工具。仓库记录了 Meshy 绑定动画、Blender 重定向和 PixelOver 精灵导出流程；没有说明确切编程模型或各助手的代码分工。游戏里的 NPC 队友并不是 AI 辅助开发的证据。",[6986,6987,6988,1138,6989],"GPT Image 2","PixelLab","Meshy","PixelOver","Godot 4.7 · GDScript · 2D / GL Compatibility",[6986,6987,6988,1138,6989],{"_68":6977,"_32":6978,"_24":1782},{"_68":6973,"_32":6965,"_24":1151,"_93":6974},{"_68":3959,"_32":6969,"_1489":1490,"_93":6970},{"_68":6964,"_32":6965,"_93":6966},[1781,1189,2305,6997,1192],"meshy",{"_6999":7000},"documents",{"_80":7001,"_42":7002},[7004,7008,7009,7010,7007,7011,7012,7013,7014,7015,7016,7017,7018,7019,7020,7021,7022,7023,7024,7025,7026,7027,7028,7029,7030,7031,7032,7033,7034,7035,7036,7037,7038,7039,7040,7041,7042,7006,7043,7005,7044,7045,7046,7047,7048,7049,7050,7051,7052,7053,7054,7055,7056,7057,7058,7059,7060,7061,7062,7063,7064],[7003,7004,7005,7006,7007],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","editorial-art-prompts","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","skills/level-design/references/culture-history","skills/level-design/references/foundations","skills/level-design/references/learning","skills/level-design/references/lighting-art","skills/level-design/references/optimization-release","skills/level-design/references/scripting-doors","skills/level-design/references/source-map","skills/level-design/references/spatial-layout","skills/level-design/references/tools-quake","skills/level-design/references/wayfinding-playtesting","skills/level-design/templates/level-brief","skills/level-design/templates/playtest-report","skills/level-design/templates/review"]
